  <para style="h">Yọsua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yọsua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yọsua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yọs</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yọsua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Etem Yọsua Nte Adadusʌñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Ke Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakekpa, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ayịn Nọn, asañautom Moses ate: <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Moses awo utom mmi akpa. Idaha ado, afo ye afịd ibon ami, ibeeñe idem adisaña ñkaaña Inyañ Yọdan ndʌk isọñ a-ami ñyemme adinọ, nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Ami ñyainọ ndufo afịd itie se ndufo ediideep ñkpad, naña ami ñkenwọñọ nnọ Moses. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Adaña ndufo ayaatọọñọ ke akpautatan akewuọ Lebanọn, atọọñọ ke ekamba inyañ, Yufretis, afịd isọñ mbon Hed, adat akewuọ Akpainyañ Mediterenia ke edem usobutịn. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Awo ndomokeed idiikanna ubiọọñọ fiin ke afịd ayio uwem mfo. Naña ami ñkeba ye Moses, kpa ntoro ke ndiiba ye afo; ami ndiidakkake ukpọñ fiin, ndiinyʌññọ utop fiin nduọọk. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Sọñ ubọk nyʌñ kop uko, sia afo ayaadat mbon ami usʌñ nọ ekedat isọñ a-ñkenwọñọke adinọ mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />“Sọñ adudu nyʌñ nekke kop uko. Nekke kpeme adinam afịd mbed se Moses awo utom mmi akunọọ fiin; kuuwọññọ ukpọñ ammọ ukaa nnasia me ufiin, nọ ato do ndufo enie mfọn ke itie akeedodo a-ndufo ekaaha. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Sịn Ñwed Mbed ami ke esịd mfo afịd ini; kere baña anye uweemeayio ye akonayio, nọ ato do afo akpeme adinam afịd se ewet ke esịd amọ. Ntom ke afo uduumọinyọ unyʌñ ukịt mfọn ke usʌñ mfo. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Nte idooho ami udọkkọ fiin? Sọñ ubọk nyʌñ kop uko. Kuukop ndịk; kuunyʌñ uyak esịd uduọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ayaaba ye afo nte afo akaka.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Ndin Yọsua amaanọ mme ñkpisọñ abio uyio ate: <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Isaña ke ufọk nnaa iboiyo inyʌñ idọkkọ mbon awo ite, ‘ineeñe mme ñkpọ ndufo ibono. Usen ita asʌhọ ndufo adikaaña Yọdan ñkedat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ enie nte ake ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Ado Yọsua amaabo nditọ Rubịn, nditọ Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase, ate, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Itoiyo se Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akidọkkọ ndufo ate enam ke ini anye akebooho ate, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayainọ ndufo nduọkadudu ke adinọ ndufo isọñ ami.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Ibaan ndufo, nditọ ndufo ye ufene ndufo ekeme ediba ke isọñ ake Moses akinọọhọ ndufo ke edem usakkautịn Yọdan, ado afịd ideen uko ndufo, e-ebọbọke mbọbọekọñ, ana ebem nditọ Isrel mbon ñko ekaaña eka edem uko. Ana ndufo enwam ammọ <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />tutu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ ammọ nduọkadudu, naña anam inọ ndufo, ñko tutu ammọ edat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anọọhọ ammọ enie. Amaama ado, ndufo emekeme editịmme ñnyọñ ñkeba ke isọñ ndufo, ake Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akinọọhọ ke edem Yọdan uko, ke ukañ usakkautịn.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ndin ammọ emaebọọrọ Yọsua ete, “Se akpedodo a-afo abooho ñnyịn inam iyainam, ñko itie nte afo idọdọñ ñnyịn iyaikaa. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Kpa naña ñnyịn ikikop uyio Moses ayọhọ-ayọhọ, kpa ntoro ke ñnyịn idiikop uyio mfo. Ado yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo akap aba ye afo naña anye akeba ye Moses. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Awo akeedodo a-afaañake ikọ mfo anyʌñ asịn adikop, ke se adodo a-afo adiibo ammọ enam, eyaewot ammọ. Kap sọñ ubọk nyʌñ kop uko!”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rahab ye Mbon Uyeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Ndin Yọsua ayịn Nọn amaatie ke Sitịm adọñ mbon uyeb iba ke ndịbe. Anye amaabo ammọ, “Ikaa, ikise isọñ ado, akpan-akpan Yeriko.” Ammọ ndin emaedaaña ekaa ekedʌk ufọk awonwaan akpara keed a-akekereke Rahab enyʌñ eba do.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Emaetañ enọ adidem Yeriko ebo, “Sese, usʌk nditọ Isrel emaedi mi akonayio ami edidiyep isọñ.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Ndin adidem Yeriko amaadọñ utom ami anọ Rahab ate: “Sio ideen e-ekediighe ubịne enyʌñ edidʌk ufọk mfo di, sia ammọ edi ediyep afịd isọñ ami.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Ado mma ado amaaben ideen iba ado adịp. Anye amaabo ate, “Ii, ideen ado emaedi embịne, ado ñkidiọọñọke nte ammọ eketo edi. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Ke ndubi, ke ini amaakesịm adibet inuaatob abio, ammọ emaenyọñọ. Ami ndiọọñọke usʌñ nte ammọ ekedʌk. Isọsọp ibịne ammọ. Emekeme edikisịme ammọ.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />(Ado anye amaaben ammọ adọọk anyọñ akọm akedịp ke idak mme eboho flaks a-anye akebonoke ke anyọñ akọm.) <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Ndin mbon ado emaebịne mbon uyeb ado ke usʌñ a-akaaha utʌñọ mmọọñ Yọdan, ndin mbon se ikibịne ammọ ekesʌk ewọwuọñọ, emaebet inuaatob abio.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Mbemiso mme mbon uyeb ado edʌk idab, mma ado amaadọọk anyọñ akọm <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />akebo ammọ ate, “Ami mmediọọñọ mbo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-aben isọñ ami inọ ndufo, ñko ke ndịk ndufo i-inam ñnyịn, anam afịd awo se idʌñ ke idʌñ ami eba ke ayeemensia ke ntak ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Ñnyịn imikop naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam mmọọñ Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ asat inọ ndufo ke ini ndufo ekewuọñọke ke Iyib, ye se ndufo ekenam Sihọn ye Ọk, ndidem Amọọ iba ado ke edem usakkautịn Yọdan, a-ndufo ekesoboke afịd-afịd. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Ke ini ñnyịn ikikoppo ñkpọ ami, nsia amaiyeeme ñnyịn ato ndịk, ndin idem amaamem afịd awo ke ntak ndufo, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado Abasi ke anyọñ ye ke isọñ.<verse eid="JOS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />“Ndin idahami, mbọk inwọñọ innọ miin ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibo ke ndufo eyaefọn mfọn ye ubon mmi, sia ami mmefọn mfọn ye ndufo. Innọ miin idiọọñọ akpanikọ <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />ibo ke ndufo eyaenịm ete ye eka mmi, mme nditọeka mmi ideen ye ibaan, ye afịd se inie ammọ uwem, ke ndufo eyaifak ñnyịn esio ke ñkpa.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Mbon ado emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Uwem ñnyịn aka ke uwem ndufo! Afo umuudọkkọke awo se ñnyịn inam, iyaifọn mfọn ye afo inyʌñ inam akpanikọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amainọ ñnyịn isọñ ami.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Ndin anye amaayịt udʌk anọ ammọ eto ubenafịm ewuọññọ, sia ufọk amọ akedo ke ndibene abio. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ikaa ke mme abod mbaak mbon se ibịne edikịt ndufo. Idịbe do usen ita tutu ammọ enyọñ edi, ndin ndufo enyọñ.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Ndin mbon ado emaebo anye ete, “Unwọñọ a-afo anamma ñnyịn ita mi idiibọppọ ñnyịn <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />ibọhọke ado ñnyịn imaidisịm mi, anye ado ke afo amaatobo ndad-ndad udʌk ami ke ubenafịm a-afo akenamma ñnyịn isaña iwuọ, aben ete ye eka mfo, nditọeka mfo ye afịd ubon mfo adisịn ke ufọk mfo. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Adieke awo ammọ ndomokeed awuọhọ ke ufọk mfo asaña ke efaak, iyiib ammọ adiidoro ammọ ke iwuod; ndin ñnyịn iyaibọkkọ. Amaado mbon e-esịneke ke ufọk ye afo, iyiib ammọ adiidoro ñnyịn ke iwuod adieke ubọk awo atuuhọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Ado afo ukpuyaara se ñnyịn inam ami, ñnyịn iyaibọkkọ unwọñọ a-afo anamma ñnyịn inwọñọ mi.”<verse eid="JOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Mmenyịmme. Yak ado naña ndufo etañ ado.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 2:21">Ndin anye amaasio ammọ unyọñ, ammọ emaenyʌñ enyọñọ. Anye amaanyʌñ adat ndad-ndad udʌk ado atobo ke ubenafịm.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Ke ammọ emaekekpọñ do, ammọ emaekaa mme abod eketie do usen ita, tutu mbon se ikibịne ammọ eyem ammọ afịd itie enyʌñ enyọñ edi awo ikịtte ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Akekem awo iba ado emaetịmme edem enyọñ. Ammọ emaesọiyọ ke mme abod, esaña eboiyo inyañ ebịne Yọsua ayịn Nọn ekedọkkọ anye afịd ñkpọ se ikitịppe inọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Ammọ emaebo Yọsua ete, “Ke akpanikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aben afịd isọñ ami isịn ñnyịn ke ubọk; nsia ayeeme afịd awo do ke ntak ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ukaaña Yọdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Ke ataa ubakusen Yọsua ye afịd nditọ Isrel emaeto Sitịm ekaa Yọdan, itie a-ammọ ekedañña mbemiso ammọ ekaaña Yọdan. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Ke usen ita amaakeboiyo mme ñkpisọñ abio emaesaña edʌk ke itie nnaaekọñ, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />enyʌñ enọ mme awo uyio ete: “Ndufo emaekịt akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ye mme aku Lifai nana ebiom anye, ndufo enie edidaaña nda ke itie ndufo enyʌñ ekeene anye. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Ndin ndufo eyaediọọñọ nte ekaa, sia adooho akenam ndufo idʌkkọ usʌñ ami akpa. Ado iyaak ufañ ñkpọ nte tọsịn kubid iba (2,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 3,000 me mita 900</char></note> ana ke ufọọd ndufo ye akebe edioomo; ikiisaña ikpere anye.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yọsua amaadọkkọ afịd awo ate, “Inịm idem ndufo asana, sia ñkpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam utịppeñkpọ ke atu ndufo.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Yọsua amaadọkkọ mme aku ate, “Ndufo iben akebe edioomo ibem afịd awo iso iboiyo.” Ndin ammọ emaeben akebe edioomo enyʌñ ebem afịd awo iso.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Akema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Mfịn ami ami ñyaatọọñọ adukpono fiin ke iso afịd Isrel, nọ ammọ ediọọñọ ke mmọdo mba ye afo naña ñkeba ye Moses. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Dọkkọ mme aku e-ebiommo akebe edioomo ate: ‘Ndufo imaiwuọ mben mmọọñ Yọdan, ikaa ikida ke esịd inyañ ado.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Yọsua amaadọkkọ nditọ Isrel ate, “Idi mi idikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Ntom ke ndufo ediidiọọñọ ke aduuwem Abasi mmọdo ke atu ndufo ndin ke akpanikọ anye ayaabịn mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, mbon Hif, mbon Peris, mbon Keekasi, mbon Amọọ ye mbon Yebus asio. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Sese, akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd ederimbod ayaibem ndufo iso akedʌk Yọdan. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Ndin idahami, isio awo duob mme iba ke mme esiin Isrel, awo keed ke esiin keed. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Ndin mme aku ebiommo akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd ederimbod, emaesʌk ededep ikpad ke Yọdan, mmọọñ amọ a-atooho adoro asọiyọ aka usuuk ayaakpịkke atuak ada nte eboho keed.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Ke ini atu awo ewuuñọke ke mme ufọk nnaa ammọ nọ ato do ekaaña Yọdan, mme aku e-ebiommo akebe edioomo emaeboiyo iso enọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Yọdan asiba ke atọ ke afịd ini idọk, ado ke ini mme aku e-ekebiommo akebe edioomo ekewuọhọ Yọdan nọ ikpad ammọ atuuk mben mmọọñ, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />mmọọñ a-atooho ke anyọñ-anyọñ adoro amaatuak ada. Anye amaaboho itie keed ke ataa anyan usʌñ, ke abio e-ekoodo Adam, ke ñkanñkʌk Saretan, ke ini emaekpịkke mmọọñ a-akefegheke asọiyọ aka Inyañ Araba (a-adooho, Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ), afịd-afịd esio. Ndin mme awo emaesaña eboiyo ke nsakiso Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Mme aku se ikibiom akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaetuak eda ke ufọọd Yọdan ke nsaad isọñ, ke ini afịd Isrel ekesañake eboiyo tutu afịd nditọ Isrel esaña eboiyo ke nsaad isọñ.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Ke ini afịd idịd emaekeboiyo Yọdan ema, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Sio ideen duob mme iba ke atu mme awo ami, awodeen keed ke esiin keed, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />nyʌñ dọkkọ ammọ bo edat itiad duob mme iba ke ufọọd Yọdan, ke ataa itie a-mme aku edaha, enyʌñ ebiom ammọ eboiyo ekenịm ke itie a-ndufo ediina akonayio ami.”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Ndin Yọsua amaakoot ideen duob mme iba a-anye akesioho ke atu nditọ Isrel, awodeen keed ke esiin keed, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />Yọsua amaanyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ndufo isaña iboiyo ke iso akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idʌk ke ufọọd Yọdan. Awo keedekeed anie adiben itiad ke afara amọ, naña ibad esiin nditọ Isrel ado, <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />nọ ado idiọọñọ ke ufọọd ndufo. Ke ini iso, nditọ ndufo emaibịp ndufo, ‘Mme itiad ami eda enọ soo?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Idọkkọ ammọ ibo ke mmọọñ Yọdan amaakebe ke iso akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke ini anye akeboiyoke ke Yọdan, mmọọñ Yọdan amaakebe. Mme itiad ami eyaedo ñkpọ aditoiyo enọ nditọ Isrel ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaenam naña Yọsua aketemme ammọ. Ammọ emaeben itiad duob mme iba ke ufọọd Yọdan, naña ibad esiin nditọ Isrel ado, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Yọsua; ndin ammọ emaeben ekaa itie nnaaekọñ ammọ ekenịm do. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Yọsua amaakọọk itiad duob mme iba ado ekebaaha ke ufọọd Yọdan ke itie a-mme aku e-ekebiommo akebe edioomo ekedaaha. Mme itiad ado mmọdo eda tutu mfịn.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Ndin mme aku e-ekebiommo akebe edioomo emaetuak eda ke ufọọd Yọdan tutu atu awo enam afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Yọsua abo enam, kpa naña Moses akebo Yọsua anam. Atu awo emaesọp eboiyo, <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />ndin afịd ammọ ekesʌk eboboiyo ema, akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme aku emaediboiyo ke edem uko ke iso afịd awo. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Mbon Rubịn, Kad ye ibio esiin Manase emaesaña eboiyo, eba ke mbeeñeidem ekọñ, ke iso nditọ Isrel, naña Moses aketemme ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Ñkpọ nte awo tọsịn aba e-ekebeeñeke idem ekọñ ekesaña eboiyo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> eka ekọñ ke unaisọñ Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpono Yọsua ke iso afịd Isrel; ndin ammọ emaeteeñe anye ke afịd usen uwem amọ, kpa naña eketeeñe Moses.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Dọkkọ mme aku e-ebiommo akebe edioomo mbed ate ammọ ewuọ ke Yọdan edọọk.”<verse eid="JOS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo mme aku ate, “Iwuọñọ ke Yọdan idọọk idi.”<verse eid="JOS 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ndin mme aku emaewuọñọ ke inyañ edi, ebiom akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ammọ ekesʌk ededep ñkpad ke nsaad isọñ, mmọọñ Yọdan amaamaana atọ anyʌñ ayọhọ afịd mben ikọd naña akeba akpa.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob ke akpa afiọñ, nditọ Isrel emaeto Yọdan ekena ke Kilkal ke ukañ usakkautịn Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Ndin Yọsua amaaben itiad duob mme iba a-ammọ ekedatta eto Yọdan akọọk ke Kilkal. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Anye amaabo nditọ Isrel ate, “Ke ini iso, nditọ ndufo emaebịp mme ete ammọ ebo, ‘Mme itiad ami ewuọñọ soo?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Idọkkọ ammọ ibo, ‘Isrel ekesaña ke nsaad isọñ eboiyo Yọdan.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaanam mmọọñ Yọdan asat ke iso ndufo tutu ndufo eboiyo. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaanam Yọdan ukem se anye akenam Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ ke ini anye akenamma nọ anye asat ke iso ñnyịn tutu ñnyịn isaña iboiyo. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Anye akenam ami nọ ato do afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod ediọọñọ ebo ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anie adudu, ñko nọ ndufo eteeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo afịd ini.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Ke ini afịd ndidem Amọọ e-ebaaha ke edem usobutịn Yọdan ye afịd mbọọñ Kenan e-ebaaha ke mben inyañ ekekoppo naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam nọ Yọdan asat ke iso nditọ Isrel tutu ammọ esaña eboiyo, nsia amaayeeme ammọ, ndin ammọ ikinieghe aba uko adinwana ye nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ufọọrọ Edʌd ye Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke Kilkal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Ke ini ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Bent itiad nam ikwa nyʌñ maana fọọrọ nditọ Isrel edʌd.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Ke ntoro Yọsua amaadat itiad anam ikwa anyʌñ afọọrọ nditọ Isrel edʌd ke Kibiad Haaradọd.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibiad Haaradọd awuọñọ abod ufọọrọ edʌd.</char></note><verse eid="JOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Ntak a-Yọsua akefọọrọke ideen ammọ edʌd ado ami: Afịd mbon se ikiwuọ ke Iyib, afịd ideen se iyọhọ adinwana ekọñ, emaekpañña ke anaan ke usʌñ ke emaekekpọñ Iyib. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Afịd mbon se ikiwuọ ke Iyib emaefọọrọ edʌd, ado afịd mbon se ikimana ke anaan ke usʌñ isañ e-eketooho Iyib edi ikifọọrọke edʌd. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Nditọ Isrel emaesaaña ke anaan isua aba tutu afịd ideen se ikiyọhọ adinwana ekọñ ke ini ammọ ekekpọññọ Iyib ekpañña ema, sia ammọ ikikoppo uyio Abọọñ. Sia Abọọñ amaanwọñọ anọ ammọ ate ke ammọ idiikịtte isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ammọ adinọ ammọ, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Anam anye amaaben nditọ ideen ammọ anịm ke itie ammọ, ndin ammọ edo mbon se Yọsua akefọọrọ edʌd. Ammọ ekesʌk edodo edʌd sia awo ikifọọrọ ammọ edʌd ke usʌñ isañ. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Ke emaekefọọrọ afịd idịd edʌd ima, ammọ emaeba ke nte ekeba ke ufọk nnaa ammọ tutu unan ammọ akpa.<verse eid="JOS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Ndin Abọọñ amaabo Yọsua ate, “Mfịn ami ami mmeben asuenne Iyib nsio ke idem ndufo.” Ado anam ekoot itie ado Kilkal tutu asịm mfịn ami.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Ke ndubiayio ayọhọ usen afiọñ duob mme inaañ ke afiọñ, ke ini ammọ ekebaaha ke Kilkal ke unaisọñ Yeriko, nditọ Isrel emaenam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Edem usen Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, kpa usen ado, ammọ emaedia ubaak mbunwịm isọñ ado: uyo se yiis imiisịneke ye ufọfọb abakpa. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Mana amaatre ke edem usen a-ammọ ekediaha ndidia isọñ ado; mana ikibaaha aba inọ nditọ Isrel, ado isua ado ammọ ekedia mbunwịm isọñ Kenan.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iduọ Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Ke Yọsua amaakekpere Yeriko, anye amaabenne anyen ase anyʌñ akịt awo nte ada anye ke iso ye akañkañ ke ubọk. Yọsua amaasaña abịne anye akebịp anye ate, “Afo ada inọ ñnyịn me ada anọ mme asua ñnyịn?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ndaaha nnọ awo ndomokeed, ado ndi nte adaiso udịmekọñ Abọọñ idahami.” Ndin Yọsua amaaduọ ana akʌp iso ke isọñ ke uteeñe, anyʌñ abịp anye ate, “Nsoo etob ke abọọñ mmi anie anọ isʌñutom amọ?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Adaiso udịmekọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ ate, “Sio ikpaukod mfo ke ukod mfo, sia itie a-afo adaaha mi ado adisana.” Ndin Yọsua amaanam ntoro.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Ndin emaenekke esọọñọ mme inuaatob Yeriko ke ntak nditọ Isrel. Awo ndomokeed ikiwuọhọwuọ, awo ndomokeed ikinyʌññọ idọdʌk.<verse eid="JOS 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Sese, ami mmeyaak Yeriko usịn fiin ke ubọk, ye adidem amọ ye mbon unwana ekọñ amọ. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Saña kanna abio ado akañ keed ye afịd mbon ekọñ. Nam ami ke usen itiokeed. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Yak mme aku itiaba ekama adukpoñ nnʌk akukịmedọñ ke iso akebe edioomo. Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, isaña ikanna abio ado akañ itiaba, ke ini mme aku efịtte adukpoñ. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Umaukop naña ammọ efịt anyan uyio ke adukpoñ, yak afịd mbon ekọñ ebọñ ñkpo ke akpọsọñ uyio; ndin ndibene abio ado ayaaduọ, ndin udịmekọñ ye afịd awo eyaeboiyo edʌk.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Ndin Yọsua ayịn Nọn amaakoot mme aku anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ndufo iben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌñ inam aku itiaba ekama adukpoñ ebem anye iso.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Ndin anye amaanọ mbon ekọñ uyio ate, “Itọọñọ isañ! Isaña ikanna abio, yak mbon se ikama ñkpọ ekọñ eboiyo akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iso.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Ke Yọsua amaaketañ ikọ ye atu awo ima, mme aku itiaba e-ekebiommo adukpoñ itiaba ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, emaeboiyo iso esʌk efịt adukpoñ, mbon e-ekebiommo akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ekeene ammọ ke edem. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Mbon ekọñ emaebem mme aku e-ekefịtte adukpoñ iso, mbon ekọñ mfen emaenyʌñ ekeene akebe edioomo ke edem. Afịd ini ami esʌk efịt adukpoñ. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Ado Yọsua amaanọ mbonekọñ uyio ate, “Ndufo ikiisio ñkpo ekọñ, ikiibenne uyio, ikiitañ ikọ ndomokeed tutu akem usen se ami ndiibo yak ebọñ ñkpo. Ndin ndufo ebọñọ ñkpo!” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Ndin anye amaanam eben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esaña ekanna abio ado akañ keed. Ndin mbon ekọñ emaetịmme enyọñ itie nnaaekọñ ekedaiya.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Yọsua amaabak ademme edem usen, ndin mme aku emaeben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ebiom. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Mme aku itiaba ado e-ekekamake adukpoñ itiaba emaeboiyo iso, esaña ke iso akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esʌk efịt adukpoñ. Mbon ekọñ emaeboiyo iso, mbon ukpeme akebe edioomo Abọọñ emaekeene, ke ini adukpoñ akekaaha iso afịt. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Ke ayọhọ usen iba ammọ emaesaña ekanna abio akañ keed enyʌñ etịmme enyọñ itie nnaaekọñ. Ammọ emaenam ntom ke usen itiokeed.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaba, ammọ emaebak edemme ke usiere enyʌñ esaña ekanna abio akañ itiaba ke ukem-ukem usʌñ, ado ke usen ado, ammọ ekekanna abio akañ itiaba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Ke ayọhọ akañ itiaba, ke ini mme aku ekefịtte adukpoñ, Yọsua amaanọ mbon ekọñ uyio ate, “Ibọñ ñkpo! Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaak abio inọ ndufo! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Enie adinịm abio ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd asaña-asaña nte ñkpọ nsobo nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Sʌk Rahab, akpara ado, ye afịd mbon se iba ye anye ke ufọk amọ ediidu uwem, sia anye amaadịp mbon uyeb a-ñnyịn ikidọññọ utom. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Ado ndufo ikiisaña ikpere mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ nsobo, mbaak ndufo ediben nsobo inọọ idem ndufo ke adidat mme ñkpọ ado. Imiidooho ntoro eyaenam itie nnaaekọñ Isrel akappa ado ñkpọ nsobo enyʌñ edat mfịna esọk anye. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Afịd silfa ye kold ye mme ñkpọ brọns ye ukwak edo ndisana enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ana edọñ ke itie unịmñkpọ amọ.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Ke ini mme adukpoñ ekefịtte, mbon ekọñ emaesio ñkpo, ndin ke uyio adukpoñ, ke ini ideen ekesioho akpọsọñ ñkpo, ndibene amaaduọ; ndin afịd awo emaebʌññọ edọñọ, ndin emaenyʌñ edat abio ado. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Ammọ emaeyaak abio enọ Abọọñ enyʌñ ekama akañkañ esobo afịd mme aduuwem ñkpọ ke esịd, ideen ye ibaan, ikpọawo ye ntəkayịn, mme enañ, mme edọñ ye mme dọñki.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yọsua amaabo awo iba e-ekekeyeppe isọñ ado ate, “Ikaa ufọk akpara ado inyʌñ ikisio anye ye afịd se inie anye idi, kpa naña ndufo ekenwọñọ enọọ anye.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Ndin mme ñkparawa e-ekekaaha uyeb emaedʌk ekesio Rahab, ete ye eka amọ, nditọeka amọ ideen ye ibaan ye afịd se ikinie anye ewuọ edi. Ammọ emaesio afịd ufọk amọ edi enyʌñ enịm ammọ ke itie keed ke esiin itie nnaaekọñ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Ndin ammọ emaefọp afịd abio ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd amọ, ado emaedọñ mme silfa, kold ye mme ñkpọ brọns ye ukwak ke itie unịmñkpọ ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Ado Yọsua amaayaak Rahab, akpara ado, ye ubon amọ ye afịd mbon se anye akenie, sia anye amaadịp mbon se Yọsua akedọñ eka uyeb ke Yeriko, ndin anye mmọdo adʌñ ke atu nditọ Isrel tutu mfịn.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Ke ini ado Yọsua amaanam saña-saña enwọñọ ami: “Adọdiọọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ awo a-ayemme adimaana mbọp abio Yeriko ami, Yeriko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">“Ado akpan amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">ke anye adiidat isịn itiad idakisọñ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 6:26">ado akpeedem ayịn amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 6:26">ke anye adiidat ikọọk mme inuaatob amọ.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye Yọsua, ndin etob amọ amaasuana ke afịd idʌñ.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s1">Idiọọkñkpọ Akan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Ado nditọ Isrel ikinamma akpanikọ ke abaña adisobo mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ; Ekan, ayịn Kaami, ayịn Simri, ayịn Seera, a-aketooho esiin Yuda, amaadat ubaak mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ a-akenaaha nte esobo. Ndin Abọọñ amaayat esịd ye nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Akema Yọsua amaadọñ mme awo eto Yeriko eka Ai, a-akpereke Bed Afịn ke ukañ usakkautịn Beteel, anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ndufo idọọk ika ikiyep isọñ ado.” Ndin mbon ado emaedọọk ekeyep Ai.<verse eid="JOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Ke ini ammọ emaeketịmme enyọñ ebịne Yọsua, ammọ emaebo, “Idooho afịd mbon ekọñ enie edidọọk ñkenwana ye Ai. Dọñ awo tọsịn iba (2,000) me tọsịn ita (3,000) ekedat isọñ ado; idooho se asịññe afịd mbon ekọñ, sia ibad-ibad awo edʌñọ do.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Ke ntoro ñkpọ nte awo tọsịn ita (3,000) ekedọọk eka; ado mbon Ai emaekebịne ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />mbon Ai emaewot ñkpọ nte awo edịb mme duob mme itiokeed. Ammọ emaebịne nditọ Isrel tọọñọ ke inuaatob abio tutu ekesịm mme itie ubom itiad enyʌñ ewot ammọ enịm ke mme usuuk. Ke adikop ami, esịd amaaduọ mme awo anọ ndịk anyʌñ akappa atie nte mmọọñ.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Ndin Yọsua amaawai afọñidem amọ, amaanyʌñ aduọ akʌp iso ke isọñ ke iso akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anaa do tutu ndubiayio. Mme ñkpisọñ Isrel emaenyʌñ enam ukem ado, emaeduọk ntọñ ke iwuod ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo, “O <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, ntaha afo akebenne mbon ami aboiyo Yọdan akema adiyaak ñnyịn asịn ke ubọk mbon Amọọ nọ edisobo ñnyịn-e? Ñnyịn ikpa ikikap ima aditie ke edem Yọdan uko! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Feen nọ isʌñutom mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Nsoo ke mbo ntañ, idaha ado a-mme asua Isrel emaesuan ammọ? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Mbon Kenan ye mbon mfen se idʌñ ke isọñ ami eyaekop ebaña ñkpọ ami, enyʌñ edikanna ñnyịn ekʌk, enyʌñ esọọk anyịñ ñnyịn ke iso isọñ efep. Nsoo ndin ke afo uduunam ubaña ekamba anyịñ mfo?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Dakka da! Nsoo ke afo akʌp iso mfo ke isọñ anam? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Isrel anam idiọọkñkpọ; ammọ ebiat edioomo mmi, a-ami ñkebooho ammọ enịm. Ammọ emaedat usʌk mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ nsobo; ammọ eyịp inọ enyʌñ esʌhọ nsu. Ammọ eben mme ñkpọ nsobo ado ewaak ke atu ñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ntak ado anam nditọ Isrel ikanna ida mme asua ammọ ke iso; ammọ ewọññọ iso efeghe sia emaenam ammọ edo ñkpọ nsobo. Ami ndiibaaha ye ndufo aba ibọhọke ndufo esobo asaña-asaña ñkpọ se ido se esobo ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="JOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />“Kaa, kenam afịd awo esana. Dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘Inam idem ndufo asana nọ ebeeñe idem enọ ñkpọñ; sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ ado ami: Isrel, mme ñkpọ nsobo mmọ ke atu ndufo. Ndufo ikanna idi ida iso ekọñ ye mme asua ndufo ibọhọke ndufo esiooño mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ nsobo ado.<verse eid="JOS 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />“ ‘Amaado ubakusen, iben idem ndufo idiwọt ke esiin ke esiin. Esiin ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asioho eyaedi ke ekpək ke ekpək; ekpək ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asioho eyaedi ke ubon ke ubon; ndin ubon ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asioho ayaadi ke awo ke awo. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Awo akeedodo e-emʌmmọ ye asaña-asaña ñkpọ nsobo, eyaefọp anye ke ikañ, anye ye afịd se anye anie. Anye a-abiat edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ anam abʌd-abʌd ido ke Isrel!’ ”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Ataa ubakusen edem usen Yọsua amaanam Isrel ewuọ edi ke esiin ke esiin, ndin emaesio esiin Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Mme ekpək Yuda emaewuọ edi, ndin emaesio mbon Seera. Anye amaanam ekpək Seera ewuọ edi ke ubon ke ubon, ndin emaesio Simri. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Yọsua amaanam ubon Simri ewuọ edi ke awo ke awo, ndin emaesio Ekan ayịn Kaami, ayịn Simri, ayịn Seera, a-atooho esiin Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo Ekan ate, “Ayịn mmi, nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọọñ, Abasi Isrel, nyʌñ kpono anye. Tañ se afo anam nnọ miin; kundịp miin ñkpọ.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Ekan amaabọọrọ Yọsua ate, “Ado akpanikọ! Ami mmedue <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. Se ami nnam ado ami: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Ke ini ami ñkekịtte ke atu mbịme ekọñ uyaiya afọñ keed a-atooho Babilọn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke usem Hibru ado Sina</char></note> sekel silfa ikie iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 2.3</char></note> ye ibio kold a-anieghe udob sekel aba mme duob,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 575</char></note> ami mmaasịn esịd ke ammọ ñnyʌñ ndat ammọ. Ammọ mmọdo ebʌhọ ke isọñ ke esịd atayad mmi, ye silfa ado ke idak.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Ndin Yọsua amaadọñ mme isʌñutom, ammọ emaefeeñe ekaa atayad ado, ndin sese, mme ñkpọ ado mmọdo ekebʌhọ ke atayad amọ, silfa ado asịne ke idak. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Ammọ emaesịññe mme ñkpọ ado ke atayad, ekoono esọk Yọsua ye afịd nditọ Isrel enyʌñ edeet ebon ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JOS 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Ndin Yọsua, ye afịd Isrel, emaeben Ekan ayịn Seera, ye silfa ado, ye afọñ ado, ye anyan kold ado, ye nditọ ideen ye ibaan amọ, mme enañ amọ, mme dọñki ye mme edọñ amọ, atayad amọ ye afịd se anye akenie, ekaa Abedeñ Akọọ. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yọsua amaabo ate, “Ntaha afo abenne utọ mfịna ami isọk ñnyịn-e? <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben mfịna usọk fiin mfịn ami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Ndin afịd Isrel emaetọọñ anye ke itiad, ndin ke emaeketọọñ mbon ako ke itiad ima, emaefọp ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Ammọ emaekoono ikpọ itiad efʌk Ekan ke idem, asʌkkọ ana tutu asịm usen mfịn ami. Ke ntom ke ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketekke. Anam tọọñọ ado ekoot itie ado Abedeñ Akọọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atọọ awuọñọ ntịme.</char></note><verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Esobo Ai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua, “Kuukop ndịk; kuunyʌñ uyak esịd uduọ. Ben afịd mbon ekọñ dakka dọọk Ai kaa ekọñ. Sia ami mmeyaak adidem Ai, ikọd amọ, abio amọ ye isọñ amọ usịn fiin ke ubọk. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Afo ayaanam Ai ye adidem amọ naña akenam Yeriko ye adidem amọ, ukweeñe ado ke ndufo emekeme edikoono ñkpọ mbịme ammọ ye ufene ammọ nnọ idem ndufo. Nam ndịbeuyeb ke edem abio.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Ke ntoro Yọsua amaadakka ye mbon ekọñ akaa anwan ye Ai. Anye amaamek mbon uko tọsịn edịb mme duob (30,000) adọñ ammọ eka ke akonayio <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />anyʌñ atemme ammọ abo: “Inekke ikpañ utọñ. Ndufo enie adidịbe ke edem abio nse abio. Ikiinekke ikaa inyọọñ usʌñ ikpọñ abio. Afịd ndufo itịm ikpeme. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Ami ye afịd mbon se iba ye ami iyaisaña ikpere abio, ndin ammọ emaewuọñọ idi adinwana ye ñnyịn, naña ekedak enam, ñnyịn iyaifeeñe. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Ammọ eyaibịne ñnyịn tutu ñnyịn inam ammọ ewuọ ekpọñ abio, sia ammọ eyaebo ete, ‘Ammọ efeeñe ke iso ñnyịn naña ekenam akpa.’ Anam ñnyịn imaifeeñe ke iso ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />ndufo eyaedakka eda ke itie udịbe ekedat abio. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaaben abio isịn ndufo ke ubọk. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Ndufo emaedat abio ado, isịn ikañ ke anye. Ndufo enam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo. Ikịt ibo ke emenam; ami mminọ ndufo uyio.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Ndin Yọsua amaasio ammọ adọñ, ammọ emaenyʌñ ekaa itie udịbe ekedịbe ke ufọọd Beteel ye Ai, ke ukañ usobutịn Ai, ado Yọsua amaanaa ye atu awo akonayio ado.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Yọsua amaabak adakka ada ataa ubakusen edem usen atịm mbon ekọñ amọ idem, ndin anye ye mme adadusʌñ Isrel emaebem mbon ekọñ iso ekaa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Afịd mbon ekọñ se ikiba ye anye emaesaña edọọk ekpere abio enyʌñ ekesịm iso abio. Ammọ emaenam itie nnaaekọñ ke adoro Ai, abedeñ anyʌñ aba ke ufọọd ammọ ye abio Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yọsua amaanịm ñkpọ nte awo tọsịn ition ke itie udịbe ke ufọọd Beteel ye abio Ai ke ukañ usobutịn. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Mbon ekọñ emaeda ke itie ammọ, akpan mbon ekọñ eba enọ ukañ adoro abio, ke ini mbon udịbe ekebaaha ke ukañ usobutịn abio. Ndin akonayio ado Yọsua amaakaa akedʌk abedeñ.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Ke ini adidem Ai amaakekịt ami, anye ye afịd ideen ke abio emaesọp ewuọ edi ataa ubakusen adidi nwana ekọñ ye Isrel ke itie keed a-asakkaiso ase Araba. Ado anye ikidiọọñọke ke mbon udịbe mmọdo enaa ebet anye ke edem abio. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaeyak mbon Ai ebịne ammọ, ndin ammọ emaefeeñe ekaa ukañ anaan. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Emaekoot afịd mbio Ai ete ebịne ammọ, ndin ammọ emaebịne Yọsua tutu ewuọọñọ ekpọñ abio. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Ibaaha awo ndomokeed ke Ai me Beteel i-imi ikiwuọhọ ibịne Isrel. Ammọ emaeyaak abio anaa ukpọk enyʌñ ebịne Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Ben eduad u-usịneke fiin do ke ubọk nyan se Ai, sia ñyaaben abio ado usịn fiin ke ubọk.” Ndin Yọsua amaaben eduad a-akesịneke anye ke ubọk anyan ase Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Anye akesʌk ananam ami, mbon udịbe emaesọsọp ewuọñọ edi. Ammọ emaedʌk abio enyʌñ edat anye, ndin esọsọp idem ekịm ikañ esịn.<verse eid="JOS 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ideen abio Ai emaewọññọ anyen ese edem enyʌñ eda ekịt naña nsʌñikañ ke abio adọọk anyọñ, ado ammọ ikinieghe ufañ se efeeñe eka itie ndomokeed; nditọ Isrel e-ekefeeñeke eka anaan emaewọññọ iso etịmme ebịne mbon se ikibịne ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Sia akedo Yọsua ye afịd Isrel ekekịt ke mbon udịbe edat abio, ñko ke nsʌñikañ asʌk awuọ do, ammọ emaetịmme edem ekewot mbon abio Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Mbon udịbe emaenyʌñ ewuọñọ ke abio ekebiọọñọ ammọ, anam ammọ esịne ke ufọọd, ye nditọ Isrel ke naña edem iba. Isrel emaewoot ammọ, iyakka awo ndomokeed abọkkọ asʌhọ. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Ado ammọ emaemʌm adidem Ai ye uwem, enyʌñ eben anye esọk Yọsua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Ke Isrel emaekewoot afịd mbon Ai ima ke ikọd ye ke anaan a-ammọ ekebịneke ammọ ekesịn, ndin ke emaekewoot afịd ammọ ke eduad, afịd nditọ Isrel emaetịmme ekaa Ai ekewoot mbon se ikiba do. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Ideen ye ibaan tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000) ekekpa usen ado, afịd ammọ ekedo mbon abio Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Sia Yọsua ikidʌttọ ubọk a-akekamake eduad amọ idat tutu anye asobo afịd mbon se ikidʌñ ke Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Ado Isrel emaedat ufene ye mme ñkpọ mfen ke abio ami enọ idem ammọ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Yọsua uyio.<verse eid="JOS 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Ndin Yọsua amaafọp Ai anyʌñ anam anye ado ñwuudo ke nsi-nsi, asʌk ado ndoon tutu awuọ mfịn ami. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Anye amaaben adidem Ai ayịt ke eto anịm tutu ndubiayio. Ke ini utịn amaakesop, Yọsua amaadọñ ate ekọññọ akpo amọ ke eto esio eben ekeduọọk ke inuaatob abio. Ndin ammọ emaekoono ñkpoon itiad ebok ke akpo ado, a-adooho mmọdo tutu mfịn.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udemme Edioomo ke Abod Ebal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Ndin Yọsua amaabọp akpokoro uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ke Abod Ebal <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />kpa naña Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme nditọ Isrel. Anye akebọp akeene naña ewet ke Ñwed Mbed Moses, akpokoro uwa e-enamma ke itiad a-awo imiikpịkkeke, a-awo imiikikamake ukwak idiọñ. Ammọ emaefọp ufọfọb uwa enyʌñ ewa uwa ewuana ke esịd enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Ke ndo, ke iso nditọ Isrel, Yọsua amaawet mbed Moses ke mme itiad. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Afịd nditọ Isrel, ye mme ñkpisọñ ammọ, ye mme adaaha ye mme abiideikpe ammọ ekeda ke naña ñkañ iba akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke iso mme aku Lifai e-ekebiommo akebe ado. Mme isenawo emaedʌññọ ke atu ammọ ye mme amanaisọñ emaeba ke ndo. Mbakka keed ke itie iba emaeda ke iso Abod Kerisịm ndin mbakka keed ako ada ke iso Abod Ebal, kpa naña Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaketatañ ke ini anye akenọọhọ ukpeebñkpọ ate ediọñ nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Ke emaekema, Yọsua amaakoot afịd ikọ mbed, mme adidiọñ ye mme isuuñọ ukem naña ewet ke Ñwed Mbed. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Ibaaha ikọ ndomokeed ke afịd se Moses aketañ a-Yọsua imiikikoodo inọ afịd atu awo ke Isrel, ye ibaan ye ntəkayịn, ye mme isenawo e-ekedʌññọ ke atu ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abiaña Mbon Kibiọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Ndin ke ini afịd mme ndidem e-ebaaha ke edem usobutịn Yọdan ekekoppo mme ñkpọ ami, mme mbọọñ ke abio a-abaaha ke ukañ abod-abod, ke unaisọñ ke usobutịn, ye ke afịd mben Akwa Inyañ Mediterenia tutu akewuọ Lebanọn (mbọọñ Hed, Amọọ, Kenan, Peris, Hif ye mbon Yebus), <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />emaesoobo keed nọ enwana ekọñ ye Yọsua ye Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Ado, ke ini mbon Kibiọn ekekoppo se Yọsua akenam Yeriko ye Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />ammọ emaesio ñkara: ammọ emaekaa nte mme isʌñutom, eben ñkaan ekpad ye ñkaan ikpa emaekewaiya nọ ekịm, edot mme dọñki ammọ ke edem. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Ammọ ekesịne ñkaan ikpaukod e-emaekekịm enyʌñ esịne ñkaan afọñ ke idem. Afịd uyo ye ndidia ammọ amaasaat anyʌñ afịd. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Ndin ammọ emaebịne Yọsua ke itie nnaaekọñ ke Kilkal enyʌñ ekebo anye ye nditọ Isrel ete, “Ñnyịn ito anyan usʌñ idʌñ idi; inam edioomo ye ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Nditọ Isrel emaebo mme Hif ete, “Akemeido ndufo emedʌñ ikpere ñnyịn, die ndin ke ñnyịn idiinam edioomo ye ndufo?”<verse eid="JOS 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Ammọ emaebo Yọsua ete, “ñnyịn ido mme isʌñutom mfo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:8">Ado Yọsua amaabịp ammọ ate, “Ndufo edo mme anie, enyʌñ eto uke?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ ete: “Ñnyịn mbon utom mfo ito ataa anyan usʌñ idʌñ idi ke ntak etob a-ñnyịn ikoppo ibaña Abọọñ Abasi ndufo. Sia ñnyịn imikop afịd se anye akenam ke Iyib, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />ye afịd se anye akenam ndidem Amọọ iba ke edem usakkautịn Yọdan, Sihọn adidem Hesbọn, ye Ọk adidem Basan, a-akekarake ke Astarọd. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Ndin mme ñkpisọñ ñnyịn ye afịd mbon se idʌñ ke idʌñ ñnyịn ibo ñnyịn ete, ‘Ndufo idat ndidia usʌñ isañ, ikaa ikisoobo ye ammọ inyʌñ ibo ammọ ete, “Ñnyịn ido mme mbon utom ndufo; inam edioomo ye ñnyịn.” ’ <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Uyo ñnyịn ami akesʌk afiop idaha ñnyịn ikikoonoke ammọ idọñ ke ñkpọ ke ufọk, ke usen a-ñnyịn ikibooho idi mi. Ado idahami sese naña esaat enyʌñ efịt. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Ñko mme ikịmukọd e-ekedọññọ ukọd eyọhọ ekedoñño ufa, ado se naña ammọ esaiya. Afọñidem ñnyịn ñko, ye ikpaukod ñnyịn etaha ema ato anyan usʌñ isañ.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Nditọ Isrel emaebọ ndidia ammọ edia, ado ikiibịppe Abọọñ. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Ndin Yọsua amaanam edioomo emem ye ammọ adiyak ammọ edu uwem, ndin mme adadusʌñ esob emaesọọñọ ke adinam enwọñọ.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Usen ita amaakeboiyo nte ammọ ekenam edioomo ye mbon Kibiọn, nditọ Isrel emaekop ke ammọ edo mme mbọhọidʌñ, ke edʌñ ediana ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Anam nditọ Isrel emaedakka isañ, ndin ke ayọhọ usen ita ammọ emaekewuọ abio ammọ: Kibiọn, Kefira, Beerod ye Kiriad Yerịm. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Ado nditọ Isrel ikinamma ikọ ye ammọ, sia mme adadusʌñ ke esob emaenam enwọñọ ye ammọ ke añyịñ Abọọñ Abasi Isrel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:18">Afịd esob emaedukuunọ ye mme adadusʌñ, <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />ado afịd mme adadusʌñ emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn imainam enwọñọ ye ammọ ke añyịñ Abọọñ Abasi Isrel, anam ñnyịn ikemeke adituuk ammọ aba. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Se ñnyịn idiinam ammọ ado ami: Ñnyịn iyaiyaak ammọ edu uwem, mbaak iyadesịd Abasi adikeene ñnyịn ke adibiat enwọñọ a-ñnyịn ikinwọñọke inọọ ammọ.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Ndin ammọ emaebo, “Yak ammọ edu uwem, ado yak ammọ edo mme asiakifia ye mme abọ mmọọñ nnọọ afịd esob.” Ke ntoro, enwọñọ mme adadusʌñ amaasọọñọ ada.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Ndin Yọsua amaakoot mbon Kibiọn anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ntak a-ndufo ekibiañake ñnyịn ebo ‘Ñnyịn idʌñ ke anyan usʌñ,’ ke ini ndufo edʌññọ ikpere ñnyịn-e? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Ndufo eba ke isuuñọ idahami: Tutu amama ndufo idiitreke edido mme asiakifia ye mme abọọ mmọọñ nnọọ ufọk Abasi mmi.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ Yọsua ete, “Emaenekke edọkkọ mbon utom mfo naña Abasi mfo akenọọ awo utom amọ Moses uyio ate adat afịd isọñ ami inọ ndufo anyʌñ asobo afịd mme andidʌñ ke esịd ke iso ndufo. Ntak ado akenam ñnyịn ikop ndịk ibaña uwem ñnyịn ke ntak ndufo, ndin ado akenam ñnyịn inam ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Ñnyịn isịne ke ubọk mfo idaha ado. Nam se afo akịt abo ke a-afọn anyʌñ anen afo adinam.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Ntom ke Yọsua akenyaaña ammọ asio ke ubọk nditọ Isrel, ndin ammọ ikiwotto ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Ke usen ado Yọsua amaanịm mbon Kibiọn nte mme asiakifia ye mme abọọ mmọọñ nnọọ esob, ye mme andinọ se eyem ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiimek. Se ammọ enyʌñ edo adoro tutu asịm mfịn.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s1">Utịn Atuak Ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Akema Adọni-Sedek adidem Yeruselem amaakop ke Yọsua amaadat Ai anyʌñ asobo anye afịd-afịd, anam Ai ye adidem amọ naña anye akenam Yeriko ye adidem amọ, ñko ke mbon Kibiọn emaenam edioomo emem ye Isrel enyʌñ ekappa edo mme imaan ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Anye ye mbon amọ emaekop ndịk eti-eti ebaña ñkpọ ami, sia Kibiọn akedooho akpan abio, nte keed ke atu mme abio adidem; anye amaakpon akan Ai, afịd ideen do ekenyʌñ edoñño nti mme anwana ekọñ. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Ndin Adọni-Sedek adidem Yeruselem amaakpeiye Hoham abọọñ Hibrọn, Piram adidem Yamuud, Yafia abọọñ Lakis ye Debi adidem Eklọn. <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />Anye amaabo ammọ ate, “Ndufo idọọk idiñnyaaña miin nọ inwana ye Kibiọn, sia anye a-akenam emem ye Yọsua ye nditọ Isrel.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Ndin mme ndidem Amọọ ition, mme ndidem Yeruselem, Hibrọn, Yamuud, Lakis ye Eklọn emaediana keed. Ammọ emaedọọk ye afịd mbon ekọñ ammọ ekeba ekpere Kibiọn enyʌñ enwana ekọñ ye ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Mbon Kibiọn emaedọñ utom enọ Yọsua ke nnaaekọñ ke Kilkal ete: “Kuudakka ukpọñ mbon utom mfo. Sọsọp dọọk di difak ñnyịn! Inyaaña ñnyịn, sia afịd mme ndidem Amọọ e-ebaaha ke mme idʌñ abod ediana keed edinwana ye ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Ndin Yọsua amaato ke Kilkal adọọk adi ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ, ye afịd mme nti anwanaekọñ. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Kuuyak ndịk ammọ unam fiin; ami mmeyaak ammọ usịn fiin ke ubọk. Ibaaha awo ammọ ndomokeed se idiikan uda fiin ke iso.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Ke Yọsua amaakesaña afịd akonayio ito Kilkal, anye amaadiben ammọ ke adiwad. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịn ndutịme ke ufọọd ammọ ke iso Isrel, anam Yọsua ye nditọ Isrel emaekan ammọ afịd-afịd ke Kibiọn. Isrel emaebịne ammọ edʌk ke usʌñ a-akaaha Bed Họrọn, enyʌñ ewot ammọ tutu esịm Aseka ye Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Nte ammọ efeeñeke ke iso Isrel ke usʌñ e-etooho Bed Họrọn edika Aseka, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatoomo ikpọ edịmitiad atọọñ ammọ, ndin mbon se ikikpañña ke edịmitiad emaewak ekan mbon se nditọ Isrel ekewot ke akañkañ.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Ke usen <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akebenne mbon Amọọ anọ Isrel, Yọsua amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso Isrel ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Utịn, tuak da ke Kibiọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:12">afo afiọñ ñko, tuak da ke Abedeñ Aiyalọn.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Ndin utịn amaatuak ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">afiọñ ñko amaatuak ada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOS 10:13">tutu idịd ado ekịt unen esio mme asua ammọ usiene,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JOS 10:13">kpa naña ewet ke Ñwed Yasaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Ayio amaatuak ada ke ufọọd anyọñ inyʌññọ isọp adisọiyọ ke afịd usen keed. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Utọ usen ntoro akenam ibaaha, me mbemiso usen ado, me ke usen ado amaakeboiyo, usen <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akekpañña utọñ anọ awo. Ke akpanikọ Abọọñ akenwana ekọñ anọ Isrel!<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaetịmme enyọñ itie nnaaekọñ ke Kilkal.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Mme Mbọọñ Amọọ Ition</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Ndin mme ndidem ition ado emaefeeñe ekedịbe ke abaitiad ke Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Ke ini emaekedọkkọ Yọsua ebo ke ekịt mme ndidem ition ado nte edịbe ke abaitiad ke Makeda, <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Yọsua amaabo, “Ndufo ikpat ñkpoon itiad idot ke inua abaitiad ado, inyʌñ imek mme ideen inịm do nọ ekpeme anye. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Ado ndufo ikiituak ida; ibịne mme asua ndufo! Ito iwot mbon e-ekpereke edem, ikiinyʌñ iyak ammọ edʌk abio ammọ, sia Abọọñ Abasi ndufo a-aben ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk.”<verse eid="JOS 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Ntom ke Yọsua ye nditọ Isrel ekekan ammọ afịd-afịd, ado ibad-ibad awo emaemiañña ekewuọ mme abio ammọ se inie ndibene. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Afịd udịmekọñ ado emaetịmme enyọñ ebịne Yọsua ke itie nnaaekọñ ke Makeda ke ifuuro, ndin awo ndomokeed ikitañña idiọọk ikọ ibaña nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Yọsua amaabo, “Ikʌppọ inua abaitiad ado inyʌñ isịññe mme ndidem ition ado insọk.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Ndin ammọ emaesịññe mme ndidem ition ado ke aba edi, mme mbọọñ Yeruselem, Hibrọn, Yamuud, Lakis ye Eklọn. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Ke ammọ emaekekoono mme ndidem ado isọk Yọsua, Yọsua amaakoot afịd mbon Isrel anyʌñ abo mme adaiso ekọñ e-ekesañake ye anye ate, “Ndufo isaña ikpere inyʌñ iben ukod ndufo idot mme mbọọñ ami ke itọñ.” Ndin ammọ emaesaña ekpere enyʌñ eben ukod ammọ edot ammọ ke itọñ.<verse eid="JOS 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yọsua amaabo ammọ ate, “Ndufo ikiifeghe ndịk; ikiiyak esịd iduọ ndufo. Isọñ ubọk inyʌñ isọñ esịd. Se Abọọñ adiinam afịd mme asua se ndufo eyem edinwana ekọñ ado ami.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Ndin Yọsua amaawot mme mbọọñ ition ado anyʌñ akoono akpo ammọ akọọñ ke eto, ndin ammọ emaekọñọ ke eto tutu ndubiayio.<verse eid="JOS 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Ke utịn amaakesop, Yọsua amaanọ uyio ndin emaekọññọ ammọ ke eto etoomo edọñ ke abaitiad a-ammọ ekedịbeke. Ammọ emaetañ ikpọ itiad ebon ke inua abaitiad ado, a-adooho mmọdo eba tutu mfịn.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekan Mme Abio ke Usuuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Usen ado Yọsua amaadat Makeda. Anye amaasobo abio ado ye adidem amọ ye afịd awo do ke akañkañ. Anye ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed ye uwem. Ndin anye amaanam adidem Makeda naña anye akenam adidem Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaedakka ke Makeda ekaa Libna ekenwana ekọñ. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadat abio ado ye adidem amọ asịn Isrel ke ubọk ñko. Yọsua amaasobo abio ado ye afịd awo ke esịd. Anye ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed do ye uwem. Ndin anye amaanam adidem abio ado naña akenam adidem Yeriko.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel ñko emaedakka ke Libna ekaa Lakis, akenam nnaa ekọñ anyʌñ anwana ye anye. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaak Lakis asịn Isrel ke ubọk, ndin Yọsua amaadat anye ke ayọhọ usen iba. Anye amaasobo abio ado ye afịd awo ke esịd, kpa naña akenam ye Libna. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Etaññatañ mi, Horam adidem Kesa amaadi adinwam Lakis, ado Yọsua amaakan anye ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ tutu awo ndomokeed isʌhọke.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaedakka ke Lakis ekaa Eklọn; ammọ emaenam nnaa ekọñ do enyʌñ enwana ekọñ ye abio ado. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Ammọ emaedat abio ado kpa usen ado enyʌñ esobo anye ye afịd awo ke esịd, ukem naña ekenam Lakis.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaedakka ke Eklọn ekaa Hibrọn ekenwana ekọñ ye anye. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Ammọ emaedat abio ado enyʌñ esobo anye, ye adidem amọ, ye afịd mme idʌñ ñkọrọ ye afịd awo do. Ammọ ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed ye uwem. Kpa naña ekenam ke Eklọn, ammọ emaesobo afịd abio ye afịd awo ke esịd.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Ndin Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaekanna ekaa Debi ekenwana ekọñ ye anye. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Ammọ emaedat abio ado, ye adidem amọ ye mme idʌñ amọ, enyʌñ esobo afịd ammọ. Ammọ emaesobo afịd awo do. Ammọ ikikpọññọ awo ndomokeed ye uwem. Ammọ emaenam Debi ye adidem amọ ukem se ekenam Libna ye adidem amọ ye Hibrọn.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Ntom ke Yọsua akekan afịd isọñ ado, ye mme idʌñ ikpọabod, Nekef, ye mme ntək abod ke ukañ usobutịn ye ke usuuk ikpọabod, ye mme ndidem ammọ. Anye ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed ye uwem. Anye amaasobo ukeed se ikinweek inweek afịd-afịd kpa naña Abọọñ, Abasi Isrel, akenọọ uyio abo enam. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yọsua amaakan ammọ tọọñọ ke Kades Banie tutu akewuọ Kasa, ye afịd isọñ Kosen tutu awuọ Kibiọn. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Yọsua amaakan afịd mme ndidem ami ye mme isọñ ammọ ke isañ ekọñ keed, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, akenwana ekọñ anọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Akema Yọsua ye afịd Isrel emaetịmme enyọñ itie nnaaekọñ ke Kilkal.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ekan Mme Mbọọñ Adoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Ke ini Yabịn adidem Hasọ akekoppo ñkpọ ami, anye amaadọñ utom anọ Yobab adidem Madọn, adọñ anọ mme ndidem Simrọn ye Aksaf, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />ye mme ndidem adoro-adoro e-ekedʌññọ ke mme ikpọabod, ke Araba ke usuuk-usuuk Kinered, ke mme usuuk abod ke ukañ usobutịn ye ke Nafọd Dọọ ke usobutịn; <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />adọñ anọ mbon Kenan ke usakkautịn ye ke usobutịn; adọñ anọ mbon Amọọ, mbon Hed, mbon Peris ye mbon Yebus ke abod-abod idʌñ; ye mbon Hif ke ukod Hemọn ke isọñ Mispa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Ammọ emaewuọñọ edi ye afịd mbon ekọñ ammọ ye ataa uwak enañmbakara ye ataa ekamba udịm sariọd, ewak nte ntan ke mben inyañ. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Afịd mme ndidem ami emaediana keed enyʌñ ekenam nnaaekọñ ke mben Mmọọñ Merom adinwana ekọñ ye Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate, “Kuuyak ndịk ammọ unam fiin, sia ke ukem ini ami ñkpọñ ami ñyaayaak afịd ammọ adukpo ndọñ Isrel ke ubọk. Afo anie adikpok mme enañmbakara ammọ akpan asịb anyʌñ afọp mme sariọd ammọ ke ikañ.”<verse eid="JOS 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Ke ntoro Yọsua amaadi ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ, adiben ammọ ke adiwad ke mben Mmọọñ Merom enyʌñ ebịmme ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />ndin Abọọñ amaayaak ammọ asịn Isrel ke ubọk. Ammọ emaekan ammọ enyʌñ ebịne ammọ tutu ekewuọ Akwa Sidọn, ewuọ Misrefod Maim ye Abedeñ Mispa ke ukañ usakkautịn, tutu awo ndomokeed ikisʌhọke ye uwem. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yọsua amaanam ammọ kpa naña Abọọñ akenọọ uyio: Anye amaakpok mme enañmbakara ammọ akpan asịb, anyʌñ afọọmọ mme sariọd ammọ ke ikañ.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Ke ini ado Yọsua amaatịmme edem akedat Hasọ anyʌñ awot adidem amọ. (Hasọ akesido etubom afịd mme idịd ami.) <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Ammọ emaewot afịd awo ke abio ado. Emaesobo ammọ afịd-afịd, isʌhọke awo ndomokeed a-akenweeghe inweek, ndin anye amaafọp Hasọ ke ikañ.<verse eid="JOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Yọsua amaadat afịd abio mbọọñ ado ye afịd ndidem ammọ anyʌñ awoot ammọ ke akañkañ. Anye amaasobo ammọ afịd-afịd, naña Moses awo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Ado Isrel ikiifọppọ mme abio e-ekedaaha ke anyọñ abod ammọ ndomokeed ibọhọke Hasọ a-Yọsua akefọppọ. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Nditọ Isrel emaekoono afịd ñkpọ ke abio ado ye ufene enọ idem ammọ, ado emaewoot afịd awo tutu esobo ammọ afịd-afịd, isʌhọke awo ndomokeed a-akenweeghe inweek. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses awo amọ, ntoro ke Moses aketemme Yọsua, ndin Yọsua ñko amaanam; anye ikikpọññọ ñkpọ ndomokeed ke afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Ntom ke Yọsua akeben afịd isọñ ami: mme abod-abod abio, afịd Nekef, afịd isọñ Kosen, ye mme unaisọñ ke usobutịn, ye Araba ye mme ikpọabod Isrel ye mme unaisọñ ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />tọọñọ ke Abod Halak adọọhọ aka Sei, tutu akesịm Baal Kad ke Abedeñ Lebanọn ke ukod Abod Hemọn. Anye amaamuum afịd ndidem ammọ awoot. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yọsua amaanwana ekọñ ye afịd ndidem ado ke anyan ini. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Ke imibọhọke mbon Hif ke Kibiọn, baaba abio ndomokeed mfen ikinamma edioomo emem ye nditọ Isrel, e-ekenwanake ekọñ ye ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Sia ado Abọọñ ke idem amọ akesọọñọ ammọ esịd nọ ammọ enwana ekọñ ye Isrel, nọ anye asobo ammọ afịd-afịd, asọọk ammọ asio, ñkpeubọk ibaaha, kpa naña Abọọñ aketemme Moses.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Ke ini ado Yọsua amaakaa akesobo mbon Anak ke mme abio abod: ke Hibrọn, Debi ye Anab, ke afịd mme abio abod ke Yuda, ye ke afịd mme abio abod ke Isrel. Yọsua akesoosobo ammọ ye mme abio ammọ afịd-afịd. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Awo Anak ndomokeed ikisʌhọke ke isọñ nditọ Isrel; sʌk ke Kasa, Kad ye Asdọd ke ekesʌhọ.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Ntom ke Yọsua akedat afịd isọñ ado, kpa naña Abọọñ akedọkkọ Moses abo anam, ndin Yọsua amaadat anye anọ Isrel ke udeemeñkpọ, akeene mme esiin ammọ. Akema, isọñ amaaduọk adudu unwana ekọñ.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ndidem se Ekekan ke Ekọñ</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Mme ndidem isọñ ado a-nditọ Isrel ekekanna enyʌñ edat isọñ ammọ ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan, tọọñọ ke Itịkke Anọn tutu akewuọ Abod Hemọn, ye afịd ukañ usakkautịn Araba, edo ami:<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akedʌññọ ke Hesbọn.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 12:2">Anye akekara tọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Itịkke Anọn, tọọñọ ke ufọọd itịkke ado, tutu akewuọ Inyañ Yabọk, a-adooho adaña mbon Amọn. Ubaak itie ke Kilied akesịne do.<verse eid="JOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Anye ñko akenyʌñ akara ke ukañ usakkautịn Araba tọọñọ ke Inyañ Kalili, a-adooho Akpainyañ Kinered,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Akpainyañ Kalili</char></note> tutu akesịm Inyañ Araba (a-adooho Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ), ben kewuọ Bed Yesimod, ye ke usuuk-usuuk ke ukod usuuk Piska.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Ye adaña Ọk adidem Basan, keed ke atu akpatre mbon Refaim, a-akedʌññọ ke Astarọd ye Edrei.<verse eid="JOS 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Anye akekara Abod Hemọn, Saleka, afịd Basan tutu akewuọ adaña mbio Kesọọ ye Maaka, ye ubaak Kilied tutu akewuọ adaña Sihọn adidem Hesbọn.<verse eid="JOS 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Moses, awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ye nditọ Isrel emaekan ammọ. Ndin Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaak isọñ ado anọ mbon Rubịn, mbon Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase, ate ammọ edat enie.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Ami edo mme ndidem mme abio se Yọsua ye nditọ Isrel ekekan ke ukañ edem usobutịn Yọdan, tọọñọ ke Baal Kad ke Itịkke Lebanọn tutu akewuọ Abod Hadak, a-adọọhọ aka Sei. Yọsua akeben mme isọñ ami anọ mme esiin Isrel, akeene naña ekebakka ammọ ke ikpeghe, ate ammọ edat nte udeeme ñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Mme isọñ ado ekedo mme ñkpoon abod, mme unaisọñ ke usobutịn, Araba, mme usuuk abod, anaan ye Nekef. Mbon Hed, ye mbon Amọọ, ye mbon Kenan, ye mbon Peris, ye mbon Hif, ye mbon Hed, ye mbon Yebus e-ekenieghe mme isọñ ado.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:8" />
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 12:8">Mme ndidem ado edo ami:<verse eid="JOS 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Adidem Yeriko keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:9">abọọñ Ai (a-akpereke Beteel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itie ubọñ akam</char></note>),<verse eid="JOS 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Adidem Yeruselem keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:10">adidem Hibrọn, keed<verse eid="JOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />adidem Yamuud, keed</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:11">adidem Lakis, keed<verse eid="JOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />adidem Eklọn keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:12">adidem Kesa keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />adidem Debi keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:13">adidem Kede keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />adidem Họma keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:14">adidem Arad keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />adidem Libna keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:15">adidem Adulam keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />adidem Makeda keed</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:16">adidem Beteel keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />adidem Tapua keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:17">adidem Hefa keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />adidem Afek keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:18">adidem Lasaron keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />adidem Madọn keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:19">adidem Hasọ keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />adidem Simrọn Merọn keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:20">adidem Aksaf keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />adidem Taanak keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:21">adidem Mekido keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />adidem Kedes keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:22">adidem Yokneem ke Kamel keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />adidem Dọọ (ke Nafọd Dọọ) keed,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 12:23">adidem Koyim ke Kilkal keed,<verse eid="JOS 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />adidem Tiasa keed.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 12:24" />
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 12:24">Afịd ndidem ekedo edịb mme duob mme keed.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Isọñ se Isʌhọ Adidat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Ke ini Yọsua amaakesọñ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye ate, “Idahami afo amenekke asọñ, ndin isọñ asʌk akpokpon se isʌhọ edidat.<verse eid="JOS 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />“Isọñ se isʌhọ ado ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 13:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:2">“afịd adaña mbon Filistia ye mbon Kesọọ <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />tọọñọ ke Inyañ Sihọ ke ukañ usakkautịn Iyib tutu akewuọ adaña Ekrọn ke edem adoro, afịd ado ekebat nte ake mbon Kenan akpesʌkado a-adooho mme mbọọñ Filistia ition ke Kasa, Asdọd, Askelọn, Kad ye Ekrọn ekama;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:3">adaña mbon Afịm <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />ke edem usuuk;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:4">afịd isọñ mbon Kenan, tọọñọ ke Ara ake mbon Sidọn tutu akewuọ Afek ye adaña mme Amọọ;<verse eid="JOS 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />isọñ Baiblos;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 13:5">ye afịd Lebanọn ke ukañ usakkautịn, tọọñọ ke Baal Kad ke ukod Abod Hemọn tutu awuọ Lebo Hamad.<verse eid="JOS 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />“Amaado afịd mme andidʌñ ñkpoon abod tọọñọ ke Lebanọn wuọ Misrefod Maim, a-adooho, afịd mbon Sidọn, ami ke idem mmi ñyaabịne ammọ nsiooño ke iso nditọ Isrel. Kịt bo ke amedeeme isọñ ami anọ Isrel nte udeemeñkpọ ammọ, kpa naña ami ñkudọkkọ fiin, <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />nyʌñ bakka anye nte udeeme ke atu esiin usʌkkeed ye ibio esiin Manase.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubakka Isọñ ke Edem Usakkautịn Yọdan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Ubaak Manase uko, mme Rubịn ye mbon Kad emaebọ udeeme ake Moses akenọọhọ ammọ ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan, kpa naña anye awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedeeme anọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Aketọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Itịkke Anọn, adat akewuọ abio a-abaaha ke ufọọd itịkke, ye afịd unaisọñ Medeba tutu akewuọ Dibon, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />ye afịd abio Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akedaaha ubọọñ ke Hesbọn, tutu akewuọ mbon Amọn.<verse eid="JOS 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Amaasịne Kilied ñko, ke adaña mbon Kesọọ ye Maakad, afịd Ekamba Abod Hemọn ye afịd Basan tutu awuọ Saleka <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />a-adooho afịd isọñ Ọk ke Basan, a-akekarake ke Astarọd ye Edrei. (Anye akedo akpatre se ikisʌhọ ke atu mbon Refaim.) Moses amaakan ammọ anyʌñ abọ ammọ isọñ. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Ado nditọ Isrel ikibịnne mbon Kesọọ ye Maakad isịññe, anam ammọ esʌk edọdʌñ ke atu nditọ Isrel tutu awuọ usen mfịn ami.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Ado anye ikinọọhọ esiin Lifai udeemeñkpọ, sia adooho mme uwa ndidia e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ado udeemeñkpọ ammọ, kpa naña anye akedọkkọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Se Moses akenọọ esiin Rubịn ado ami, ke ubon ke ubon:<verse eid="JOS 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Adaña tọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Itịkke Anọn, ye ke abio a-abaaha ke ufọọd itịkke, ye afịd unaisọñ tọọñọ ke Medeba <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />wuọ Hesbọn ye afịd mme abio amọ e-ebaaha ke unaisọñ ado, ñkọrọ ye Dibon, Bamod Baal, Bed Baal Mọọn, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />Yahas, Kedemọd, Mefaad, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />Kiriataim, Sibma, Sered Saha ke anyọñ abod itịkke ado, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Bed Pio, mme usuuk Piska, ye Bed Yesimod, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />ye afịd abio ke unaisọñ ye afịd isọñ Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akedaaha ubọọñ ke Hesbọn. Moses amaakan anye ye mbọọñ mbon Midian, Efi, Rekem, Sọọ, Họọ ye Reba, mme nditọ mbọọñ e-edianake ye Sihọn e-ekedʌññọ ke abio ado. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Ke aboiyoke mbon e-ekewotto ke ekọñ, nditọ Isrel emaenyʌñ ewot Balaam ayịn Beo, a-akedooho abiaidiọñ.<verse eid="JOS 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Adaña nditọ Rubịn akedo mben inyañ Yọdan. Mme abio ami ye mme ntək idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme nditọ Rubịn, naña ubon ammọ ado.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Se Moses akenọọ esiin Kad ado ami, akeene mme ubon ammọ:<verse eid="JOS 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Adaña Yasa, afịd abio ke Kilied ye ubaak isọñ idʌñ nditọ Amọn tutu akewuọ Aroa, a-akpereke Raba; <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />anyʌñ atọọñọ ke Hesbọn akewuọ Ramad Mispa ye Betonim, anyʌñ atọọñọ ke Mahanaim akewuọ adaña Debi; <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />ye ke itịkke, Bed Haram, Bed Nimra, Sukọd ye Safọn ye ubaak isọñ Sihọn adidem Hesbọn (ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan, adaña a-akaaha akewuọ Akpainyañ Kalili, a-adooho Akpainyañ Kinered<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Akpainyañ Kalili</char></note>).<verse eid="JOS 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Mme abio ami ye mme ntək idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme nditọ Kad, akeene ubon ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Se Moses akenọọ ubaak esiin Manase ado ami, a-adooho, ubaak ekpək nditọ Manase, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Adaña a-atọọñọke ke Mahanaim, afịd Basan, ye afịd isọñ Ọk adidem Basan, afịd ntək abio Yai ke Basan, abio ata, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />mbakka iba Kilied, ye Astarọd ye Edrei (ake Ọk akedaaha ubọọñ ke mme abio Basan).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 13:31">Anye ami akenie nditọ Makia ayịn Manase, akenie ubaak nditọ Makia, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Ami ado udeeme ake Moses akenọọhọ ke ini anye akebaaha ke unaisọñ Mọb ke edem Yọdan mbeñ uko ke edem usakkautịn Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Ado amaado esiin Lifai, Moses ikinọọhọ ammọ udeemeñkpọ; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ado udeeme ammọ, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ anọ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ubakka Isọñ Edem Usobutịn Yọdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Mme itie a-nditọ Isrel ekebọọhọ nte udeeme ke isọñ Kenan, ake Eliasa aku, Yọsua ayịn Nọn ye mme mbọọñ ekpək ke mme esiin Isrel ekedeemeke enọ ammọ edo ami. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Udeeme mme esiin usʌkkeed, ye ubaak esiin keed, akesaña ke afia, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeboiyo ke Moses awuuk. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Moses amaanọnọ esiin iba ye ubaak esiin keed udeeme ammọ ke ñkañ edem usakkautịn Yọdan, ado ikinọọhọ mme Lifai udeeme ke atu mbon ako, <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />sia nditọ Yosef ekedido esiin iba, Manase ye Ifrem. Mme Lifai ikinieghe udeemeñkpọ ke isọñ, ado ekenie abio idʌñ kpọd, mme itie awawa mbid se mme edọñ ye mme enañ ammọ edia ñkpọ. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Ke ntoro nditọ Isrel emaedeeme isọñ kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketemme Moses.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Kaleb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Akema mbon Yuda emaedibịne Yọsua ke Kilkal, ndin Kaleb ayịn Yefune awo Kenis amaabo anye ate, “Afo amediọọñọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedọkkọ Moses awo utom Abasi ke Kades Banie ubaña fiin ye ami. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Ami ñkedo isua aba ke ini Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketieghe ke Kades Banie andọñ miin abo yak ñkeyep isọñ ado. Ndin ami mmaadat mbʌk nsọk anye akeene se esịd mi akentemme, <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />ado nditọ Isrel e-ekesañake ye ami edọọk emaenam nsia ayeeme mbon awo. Ado ami mmaakeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi ke afịd esịd. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Anam usen ado Moses amaanwọñọ ambo miin ate, ‘Isọñ i-ikpad mfo akesañake adiido udeemeñkpọ mfo ye ake nditọ mfo ke nsi-nsi, sia afo amaakeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi ke afịd esịd.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke Dit 1:36</char></note><verse eid="JOS 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />“Idaha ado, kpa naña Abọọñ akenwọñọ, anye annịm miin uwem isua aba mme ition tọọñọ anye aketañ ami anọ Moses, ke ini nditọ Isrel ekesaañake ke anaan. Se miin mi mfịn ami, ndo isua anaañ mme ition! <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Idem asʌk ansọọsọñ miin mfịn ami kpa naña akensọñ usen ake Moses akensioho adọñ utom; inweek asʌk ambaaba adiwuọ ñkenwana ekọñ idahami ukem naña akemba idaha ado. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Idahami nnọ miin abod-abod idʌñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke adinnọ miin usen ado. Afo ke idem mfo amaakop ke mbon Anak mmọdo ekeba ndin ke mme abio ammọ emaekpoon enyʌñ enie ndibene, ado ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> añnwamma, ñyaabịne ammọ nsio kpa naña anye aketañ.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Ndin Yọsua amaadiọñ Kaleb ayịn Yefune anyʌñ anọ anye Hibrọn nte udeemeñkpọ amọ. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Ke ntoro Hibrọn amaakappa anie Kaleb ayịn Yefune awo Kenis tọọñọ ado, sia anye amaakeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ke afịd esịd. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />(Ekesikoot Hibrọn Kiriad Aba edian Aba, a-akedooho awo andikpon ñkan ke atu mbon Anak.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Ndin isọñ amaaduọk adudu ke unwana ekọñ.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Nnọ Esiin Yuda</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Udeeme isọñ Yuda, ke ubon ke ubon, amaakewuọ adaña Edọm, akewuọ Akpautatan Sịn ke ataa akpatre usuuk-usuuk.<verse eid="JOS 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Usuuk-usuuk adaña aketọọñọ ke itie mbeghe ubom ke ñkañ usuuk Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />aben akewuọ usuuk Usʌñ Ikpeyen, aboiyo akaa Sịn ndin adọọk akewuọ edem usuuk Kades Banie. Ndin aboiyo akaa Hesrọn adọọk akewuọ Adda anyʌñ akanna akewuọ Kaka. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Ndin aboiyo do akaa Asmọn akewuọ ke Itịkke Iyib, aketre ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia. Adaña ammọ ke usuuk-usuuk ado ami.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Adaña ke edem usakkautịn ado Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ tutu akewuọ inua Yọdan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 15:5">Adaña ke edem adoro aketọọñọ ke mbeghe ubom akpainyañ ke inua Yọdan, <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />adọọk akaa Bed Hokla anyʌñ aboiyo asaña adoro Bed Araba akewuọ Itiad Bohan ayịn Rubịn. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Adaña ado amaadọọk ndin akewuọ Debi tọọñọ ke Abedeñ Atọọ akanna adoro-adoro akewuọ Kilkal, a-asakkaiso ase Ufañ Adumịm ke usuuk idịm. Adaña amaaboiyo akewuọ mmọọñ En Semes adiwuọ ke En Rokel. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Ndin adaña ado amaasaña Abedeñ Ben Hinọm adat adọọk ke edem usuuk-usuuk abio Yebus (a-adooho, Yeruselem). Ndin amaato do adọọk atịñe abod ke ukañ usobutịn Abedeñ Hinọm ke ukañ adoro Abedeñ Refaim. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Tọọñọ ke atịñe abod adaña ado amaakaa idịm mmọọñ Neftoa, akewuọ ke mme abio ke Abod Efrọn ndin atịkke akaa Baala (a-adooho, Kiriad Yerịm). <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Ndin akanna ato ke Baala akaa edem usobutịn akewuọ Abod Sei, aboiyo akaa adoro usuuk Abod Yerịm (a-adooho Kesalon), ndin asọiyọ akaa Bed Semes akeboiyo adʌk Timna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Adaña ado amaakaa akewuọ edem adoro Ekrọn, awọññọ adʌk Sikerọn, aboiyo akaa Abod Baala akewuọ Yabneel, aketre ke mben akpainyañ.<verse eid="JOS 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Adaña ukañ usobutịn ado mben Akpainyañ Mediterenia.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 15:12" />
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 15:12">Mme adaña nditọ Yuda ke ubon ke ubon edo ami.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Nọ ato do asaña akekem ye ewʌhọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ abo enam, Yọsua amaanọ Kaleb ayịn Yefune isọñ ke Yuda, Kiriad Aaba, a-adooho Hibrọn. (Aaba akedo eteete Anak.) <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Ndin Kaleb amaatie ke Hibrọn abịn mbon Anak ita ado, Sesai, Ahiman ye Talmai, nditọ Anak. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Anye amaato do akaa ekọñ ye mbon se idʌñ ke Debi (e-ekesikoodo Kiriad Sefad). <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Ndin Kaleb amaabo ate, “Ami ñyaanọ ayịn awonwaan mmi Aksa ke ndọ nnọ awo se idiinwana nọ ñkan Kiriad Sefad.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Otniel ayịn Kenas, ayịneka Kaleb, amaakan abio ado; ndin Kaleb amaaben ayịn amọ awonwaan Aksa anọ anye adọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Usen keed ke ini Aksa akediighe abịne Otniel, anye amaanyịk anye ate yak anye abeeñe ete imọ inwañ. Ke ini anye amaakesọiyọ ke dọñki amọ, Kaleb amaabịp Aksa ate, “Nsoo ke ami ñkeme adinam unọọ fiin?”<verse eid="JOS 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Fọn akpan mfọn keed ye ami. Sia afo umaunnọ miin isọñ ke Nekef, nnọ miin mme idịm mmọọñ ñko.” Ndin Kaleb amaanọ anye iso idịm ye usuuk idịm.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Mme udeeme nditọ esiin Yuda edo ami, ke ubon ke ubon:<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Mme abio ke ataa usuuk esiin Yuda ke Nekef a-akaaha adaña Edọm ekedo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:21">Kabseel, Eda, Yakọọ, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />Kina, Dimona, Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />Kedes, Hasọ, Itnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Siif, Telem, Beelọd, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />Hasọ Hadata, Keriọd Hesrọn (a-adooho Hasọ), <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam, Sema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />Hasa Kada, Hesmọn, Bed Peled, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />Hasa Sual, Beeseba, Bisiotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baala, Iyịm, Esem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Eltolad, Kesil, Họma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Siklak, Madmana, Sansana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />Lebod, Silhịm, Ain ye Rimọn, afịd akedʌk abio edịb mme usʌkkeed dian ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Ke unaisọñ ke ukañ usobutịn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:33">Estaol, Sora, Asna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Sanoa, En Kanịm, Tapua, Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yamuud, Adulam, Soko, Aseka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Saaraim, Aditaim ye Kedera (me Kederotaim), abio duob mme inaañ ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Senan, Hadasa, Mikdal Kad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dileen, Mispa, Yokteel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakis, Boskad, Eklọn, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kabọn, Lamaas, Kitlis, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Kederọd, Bed Dakọn, Naama ye Makeda, abio duob mme itiokeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libna, Etaa, Asan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ifta, Asna, Nesịb, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Aksịb ye Maresa, abio usʌkkeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekrọn, ye mme abio amọ ye mme ntək idʌñ amọ; <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />ke ukañ usobutịn Ekrọn, afịd se ikikpere Asdọd, ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ; <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Asdọd, ye mme abio amọ; ye Kasa, ye mme abio amọ ye mme esịd idʌñ amọ, tutu akewuọ Itịkke Iyib ye mben Akpainyañ Mediterenia.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Ke abod-abod idʌñ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:48">Samia, Yattia, Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />Danna, Kiriad Sanna (a-adooho Debi), <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />Anab, Estemo, Anịm, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />Kosen, Holon ye Kilọ, abio duob mme keed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arab, Ruma, Esan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />Yanịm, Bed Tapua, Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />Humta, Kiriad Aba (a-adooho, Hibrọn) ye Siọọ, abio usʌkkeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Maon, Kamel, Siif, Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />Yesriil, Yokdeem, Sanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Keen, Kibia ye Timna, abio duob ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Halhul, Bed Sọọ, Kedọ, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />Maarad, Bed Anọd ye Eltekon, abio itiokeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriad Baal (ado ado Kiriad Yerịm) ye Raba abio iba ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Ke anaan:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 15:61">Bed Araba, Midịn, Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />Nibsan, Abio Inʌñ ye En Kedi, abio itiokeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Yuda ikikanna ibịne mbon Yebus e-ekedʌññọ ke Yeruselem isịññe; mbon Yebus mmọdo edʌñ do ye nditọ Yuda tutu awuọ mfịn ami.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Nnọọ Ifrem ye Manase</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Udeeme isọñ nnọ Yosef aketọọñọ ke Yọdan, ke mme idịm Yeriko ke edem usakkautịn, ato do asaña ke akpautatan akewuọ abod-abod idʌñ Beteel. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Ato ke Beteel (a-adooho Luus), ndin aboiyo adaña mbon Akaid ke Atarọd, <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />asọiyọ ke edem usobutịn asaña ke adaña mbon Yafled tutu akewuọ Usuuk Bed Họrọn ye Kesa, aketre ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia.<verse eid="JOS 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Ke ntoro Manase ye Ifrem, nditọ Yosef, emaebọ udeeme ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Adaña nditọ Ifrem ke ubon ke ubon, ekedo ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOS 16:5" />
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 16:5">Adaña udeemeñkpọ ammọ aketọọñọ ke Atarọd Ada ke usakkautịn akewuọ Anyọñ-anyọñ Bed Họrọn <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />anyʌñ akaiso akewuọ Akpainyañ Mediterenia. Tọọñọ ke Mikmetaad ke adoro anye amaakanna ke ukañ usakkautịn akaa Taanad Silo, aboiyo do akaa Yanowa ke usakkautịn. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Ndin anye amaato ke Yanowa akaa Atarọd ye Naara, atuuk Yeriko ndin akewuọ Yọdan. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />To ke Tapua adaña ado amaakaa Abedeñ Kana ke usobutịn aketre ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia. Udeemeñkpọ esiin nditọ Ifrem akedo ami, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Udeeme ammọ amaasịne afịd abio ye esịd idʌñ e-ekediaññake enịm enọ nditọ Ifrem ke atu udeemeñkpọ nditọ Manase.<verse eid="JOS 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Ammọ ikibịnne mbon Kenan se ikidʌñ ke Kesa; mbon Kenan esʌk edọdʌñ ke atu nditọ Ifrem tutu awuọ mfịn ami, ado ana ammọ enam utom nte mme ifʌn.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Ami ado udeemeñkpọ esiin Manase nte akpan Yosef. Makia, akpan Manase, ete mme Kilied, amaabọ Kilied ye Basan sia mbon Makia ekedo mme ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Ndin udeeme anye ami akenie nditọ Manase se ikisʌhọ, e-ekedoññoke ekpək Abiesa, Helek, Asriel, Sekem, Hefa ye Semida. Ammọ ekedo nditọ ideen Manase ayịn Yosef ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Ndin Selofehad ayịn Hefa, ayịn Kilied, ayịn Makia, ayịn Manase, ikinieghe nditọ ideen, ado amaanie nditọ ibaan; mme anyịñ ammọ ekedo Mahla, Nua, Hokla, Milka ye Tisa. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Ammọ emaedakka ebịne aku Eliasa, Yọsua ayịn Nọn, ye mme ñkpisọñ enyʌñ ekebo ete, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses inọ ñnyịn udeeme ke atu mme ayakka ñnyịn.” Anam Yọsua amaanọ ammọ udeeme ke atu nditọeka ete ammọ, akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Udeemeñkpọ Manase akedo afʌñikọd duob ñkọrọ Kilied ye Basan ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />sia nditọ ibaan Manase emaebọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ ke atu nditọ ideen amọ. Isọñ Kilied akenie nditọ ideen Manase se ikisʌhọ.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Adaña Manase aketọọñọ ke Asaa akewuọ Mikmetaad ke edem usakkautịn Sekem. Adaña ado ato ke ndo akaa usuuk-usuuk tutu akewuọ mme andidʌñ ke En Tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />(Manase akenie isọñ Tapua, ado Tapua ke idem amọ akenie nditọ Ifrem ke adaña Manase.) <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Ndin adaña ado amaasaña ke usuuk Abedeñ Kana. Mme abio Ifrem emaesịne ke atu mme abio Manase, ado adaña Manase akedo ke ukañ usuuk ukpe ndin aketre ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Isọñ ke ukañ usuuk akenie Ifrem, ake ukañ adoro akenie Manase. Adaña Manase amaakewuọ Akpainyañ Mediterenia ye Asaa ke adoro ye Isaka ke ukañ usakkautịn.<verse eid="JOS 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Ke Isaka ye Asaa, Manase ñko amaanie Bed San, Ibleem ye mbon Dọọ, Endọ, Taanak ye Mekido, dian ye mme idʌñ se ikanna ammọ ikʌk (ayọhọ ita ke atu ado ado Nafọd<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Nafọd Dọọ</char></note>).<verse eid="JOS 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Kpayeado nditọ Manase ikikanna idat mme abio ami idʌññọ, sia mbon Kenan emaekpaap esuuk edʌñ do idem edidʌñ do. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Ado ke ini nditọ Isrel emaekedisọñ adudu, ammọ emaenam mbon Kenan ekappa enam utom nte mme ifʌn ado ikibịneke ammọ isio afịd-afịd.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Nditọ Yosef emaebo Yọsua ete, “Ntak afo inọọhọ ñnyịn udeeme isọñ keed ye afʌñikọd keed nte udeemeñkpọ ñnyịn-e? Ñnyịn imiwak, ñko <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anekke idiọñ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOS 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yọsua amaabọọrọ, “Akpedo ndufo emewak ntoro, ndin akpedo abod-abod abio Ifrem asịp abọhọ inọ ndufo, ikaa akai ikitem itie do inọ idem ndufo ke isọñ mbon Peris ye mbon Refaim.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Nditọ Yosef emaebọọrọ ete, “Abod-abod abio ado ikemme ñnyịn, ñko afịd mbon Kenan se idʌñ ke unaisọñ, mbon se idʌñ ke Bed San ye mme idʌñ se ikanna ammọ ikʌk ye mbon se iba ke Abedeñ Yesriil enieñe sariọd ukwak.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Ado Yọsua amaabo mme esiin Yosef, Ifrem ye Manase, ate, “Ndufo emewak enyʌñ esọñ adudu eti-eti. Ndufo idiidatta udeemeñkpọ keed kpọd <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />ado eyaedat abod-abod akai abio ado ñko. Item anye, ndufo ediinie tutu awuọ ataa akpatre iwuod ado; akpesʌkado mbon Kenan enieñeke mme sariọd ukwak enyʌñ esọñ adudu, ndufo emekeme adibịn ammọ nsio.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ubakka Isọñ se Isʌhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Afịd esob nditọ Isrel emaekesoobo idem ke Silo enyʌñ ewuuk atayad mbono do. Abio akeba ke idak ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />ado esiin Isrel itiaba ekesʌk esọsʌhọ i-imiikibọọhọ udeemeñkpọ ammọ diin.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo nditọ Isrel ate: “Ndufo ediibet ikpeene die ndin ndufo etọọñọ adidat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme ete ndufo, akinọọhọ ndufo enie? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Isio awo ita ke esiin keedekeed. Ami ñyaasio ammọ ndọñ ekese isọñ ado enyʌñ ewet ebaña naña anye aba, akeene udeeme esiin keedekeed. Amaama ammọ eyaenyọñ embịne. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Ediibakka isọñ ado ke itie itiaba. Yuda ayaaba ke efaak amọ ke usuuk ndin mme esiin Yosef enyʌñ eba ke efaak ammọ ke adoro. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Imaiwet ibaña itie isọñ itiaba ado ima, iben insọk miin nọ nsịn afia inọ ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Ado mme Lifai inieghe udeeme ke atu ndufo, sia utom se ammọ enam enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte mme aku ado udeeme ammọ. Ndin Kad, Rubịn ye ubaak esiin Manase emaebọbọ udeeme ammọ ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan. Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ammọ.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Nte mme ideen ado etọọñọke isañ adikineeñe adaña, Yọsua amaanọ ammọ item abo, “Ikaa ikisaña iseet isọñ ado inyʌñ iwet naña aba. Imaima itịmme imbịne, ndin ami ñyaasịn afia inọ ndufo mi ke Silo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Ndin ideen ado emaedaaña ekesaaña eseet isọñ ado. Ammọ emaewet ebaña isọñ ado ke ñwed, ke abio ke abio, ke ikpeghe itiaba, ndin emaetịmme enyọñ ebịne Yọsua ke itie nnaaekọñ ke Silo.<verse eid="JOS 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Ndin Yọsua amaasịn afia anọ ammọ ke Silo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ adeeme isọñ do anọ nditọ Isrel akeene mme esiin ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Benyamin</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Akpa afia akedʌk anọ esiin Benyamin ke ubon ke ubon. Adaña ammọ akedo ke ufọọd esiin Yuda ye Yosef:<verse eid="JOS 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Adaña ammọ ke ukañ adoro aketọọñọ ke Yọdan, aboiyo ke ukañ adoro Yeriko adʌk ukañ usobutịn abod-abod abio, adiwuọ ke anaan Bed Afịn. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Adaña ato do aboiyo akaa usuuk Luus (a-adooho, Beteel) ndin asọiyọ akaa Atarọd Ada ke usuuk abod ke Usuuk Bed Họrọn.<verse eid="JOS 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Tọọñọ ke abod a-asakkaiso ase Bed Họrọn ke usuuk adaña ado akanna usuuk-usuuk akaa ukañ usobutịn adiwuọ ke Kiriad Baal (a-adooho, Kiriad Yerịm), abio mbon Yuda. Adaña ukañ usobutịn akedo ado.<verse eid="JOS 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Edem usuuk aketọọñọ ke utịd Kiriad Yerịm ke ukañ usobutịn, akewuọ ke idịm mmọọñ Neftoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Adaña ado amaasọiyọ akaa idak abod a-akesakkaiso ase Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, ke ukañ adoro Abedeñ Refaim. Anye amaasọiyọ adʌk Abedeñ Hinọm ke ukañ usuuk-usuuk abio Yebus akewuọ ke En Rokel. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Ndin akanna adọọk adoro, adʌk En Semes, aboiyo adʌk Kelilọd, akesakka iso ase Ufañ Adumịm, ndin asọiyọ akaa Itiad Bohan, ayịn Rubịn. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Ndin amaaboiyo akaa ukañ adoro Bed Araba akesọiyọ adʌk Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Ndin anye adika ukañ adoro Bed Hokla anyʌñ akanna adiwuọ ke ukañ adoro mbeghe ubom Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ, ke inua Yọdan ke usuuk. Anyem akedo adaña ukañ usuuk.<verse eid="JOS 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Yọdan akenie adaña ke ukañ usakkautịn.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 18:20">Mme adaña e-ekekannake udeeme mme ubon Benyamin ekʌk edo ami.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Esiin Benyamin ke ubon ke ubon, ekenie mme abio ami:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 18:21">Yeriko, Bed Hokla, Emek Kesis, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />Bed Araba, Semaraim, Beteel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />Affịm, Para, Ọfra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />Kefa Amọni, Ofni ye Keba, abio duob mme iba ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Kibiọn, Rama, Beerod, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />Mispa, Kefira, Mosa, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />Rekem, Iepeel, Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Sela, Halef, abio Yebus (a-adooho Yeruselem), Kibie ye Kiriad, abio duob mme inaañ ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 18:28">Udeeme Benyamin ke ubon ke ubon ekedo ami.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Simiọn</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Udiana afia akedʌk anọ esiin Simiọn ke ubon ke ubon. Udeeme ammọ akeba ke ufọọd udeeme nditọ Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Udeeme ammọ amaasịne:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:2">Beeseba (me Seba),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beeseba (me Seba), </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Beeseba, Seba, 1 Krọnikịd 4:28 inieghe Seba</char></note> Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />Hasa Sual, Bala, Esem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />Eltolad, Betul, Họma, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />Siklak, Bed Makabod, Hasa Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />Bed Lebod ye Saruhen, abio duob mme ita ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ;<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Ain, Rimọn, Etaa ye Asan, abio inaañ ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />ye afịd mme esịd idʌñ e-ekekannake mme abio ami ekʌk tutu akewuọ Baalad Bee (Rama ke Nekef).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="JOS 19:8">Ami akedo udeeme esiin Simiọn, ke ubon ke ubon. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Ekesio udeeme mbon Simiọn ke atu udeeme Yuda, sia udeeme Yuda amaakpon akan ammọ. Anam ubon Simiọn emaebọ udeeme ammọ ke esịd adaña Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Sebulọn</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Ayọhọ afia ita akedʌk anọ Sebulọn ke ubon ke ubon:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:10">Adaña udeeme ammọ amaakewuọ Sarid. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Adaña ado akekaa ukañ usobutịn akewuọ Marala, awuọ Dabesed, anyʌñ aboiyo akewuọ ukpe a-akpereke Yokneem. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Adaña ado amaakewọññọ akpọñ Sarid akaa usakkautịn ke adaña Kislọd Tabọ akewuọ Daberad anyʌñ adọọk akaa Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Ndin anye amaato do aboiyo akaa edem usakkautịn akewuọ Kad Hefa ye Ed Kasịn; adiwuọ ke Rimọn adiwọññọ akaa Nee. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Ndin amaakanna ke adoro akaa Hanatọn aketre ke Abedeñ Ifta El.<verse eid="JOS 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Kataad, Nahalal, Simrọn, Idala ye Betlehem ekesịne do. Abio duob mme iba ye mme esịd idʌñ ke ekedo.<verse eid="JOS 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Mme abio ami ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme Sebulọn, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Isaka</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Ayọhọ afia inaañ akedʌk anọ Isaka ke ubon ke ubon. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Adaña akedʌk ke:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:18">Yesriil, Kesulọd, Sunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Hafaraim, Siọn, Anaharad, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />Rabịd, Kisiọn, Ebes, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />Remed, En Kanịm, En Hada ye Bed Pases.<verse eid="JOS 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Adaña amaawuọ Tabọ, Sahasuma ye Bed Semes, ndin aketre ke Yọdan.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:22">Abio duob mme itiokeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekeba.<verse eid="JOS 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Mme abio ami ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme esiin Isaka, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Asaa</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Ayọhọ afia ition akedʌk anọ esiin Asaa ke ubon ke ubon. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Adaña akedʌk ke:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:25">Helkad, Hali, Beten, Aksaf, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />Alamelek, Amad ye Misal. Ke usobutịn adaña amaawuọ Kamel ye Sihọ Libnad. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Ndin akanna awọt usakkautịn akaa Bed Dakọn, akewuọ Sebulọn ye Abedeñ Ifta El, ndin akaa adoro akewuọ Bed Emek ye Neiel, aben akewuọ ke ufiin Kabul. <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Amaakaa Abdọn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Hibru se ñko Yọsua 21:30; ataa uwak ikpañwed ado Ebrọn</char></note> Rehob, Hamọn ye Kana, tutu akewuọ Ataa Ekamba Sidọn. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Adaña amaamaana awọññọ edem akaa Rama ye akpọsọñ abio Tai, amaana awọññọ akaa Hosa adiwuọ ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia ke ukañ Aksịb, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />Umma, Afek ye Rehob.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:30">Ekedo abio edịb mme iba ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Mme abio ami ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeemeñkpọ esiin Asaa, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Naftali</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Ayọhọ afia itiokeed akedʌk anọ Naftali, ke ubon ke ubon:<verse eid="JOS 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Adaña ammọ aketọọñọ ke Helef ye ekamba eto ke Saananịm, abọhọ Adami Nekeb ye Yabneel akewuọ Lakum aketre ke Yọdan. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Adaña amaato ke edem usobutịn, ke Asnọd Tabọ adiwuọ ke Hukọk. Adikiwuọ Sebulọn ke usuuk, Asaa ke usobutịn ye Yuda ke usakkautịn ke Yọdan.<verse eid="JOS 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Mme abio e-ekenieghe ndibene ekedo Sidịm, See, Hamad, Rakad, Kinered, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />Adama, Rama, Hasọ, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />Kedes, Edrei, En Hasọ, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />Yirọn, Mikdal El, Horem, Bed Anad ye Bed Semes.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:38">Abio duob mme usʌkkeed ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ke ekedo.<verse eid="JOS 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Mme abio ami ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme esiin Naftali, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ Daan</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Ayọhọ afia itiaba akedʌk anọ esiin Daan ke ubon ke ubon. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Adaña udeeme ammọ akedo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 19:41">Sora, Estaol, Ir Semes, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />Saalabịn, Aiyalọn, Itla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />Elon, Timna, Ekrọn, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />Elteke, Kibetọn, Baalad, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />Yehud, Bene Berak, Kad Rimọn, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />Me Yaakọn ye Rakọn, ye efaak asakka iso ase Yopa.<verse eid="JOS 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />(Ke ini adaña mbon Daan akebọkkọke ammọ, ammọ emaekaa ekenwana ekọñ ye Lesem, ekekan, esobo anye ke akañkañ enyʌñ edat isọñ ado enie. Ammọ emaedʌñ ke Lesem enyʌñ ekoot anye Daan, a-adooho anyịñ eteete ammọ.)<verse eid="JOS 19:47" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Mme abio ami ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ekedo udeeme esiin Daan, ke ubon ke ubon.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Ake Yọsua</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Ke emaekedeeme isọñ ima ke ikpeghe ke ikpeghe, nditọ Isrel emaenọ Yọsua ayịn Nọn udeeme ke atu ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio. Ammọ emaenọ anye abio a-anye akeyemme, Timnad Sera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enyʌñ ediọọñọ nte Timnad Heres (se ke Ñwed Mme Abiideikpe 2:9)</char></note> ke abod-abod abio Ifrem. Ndin anye amaabọp abio ado anyʌñ adʌñ do.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Mbon ami edo mme abio ake aku Eliasa, Yọsua ayịn Nọn ye mme mbọọñ ekpək ke Isrel ekedatta afia edeeme enọ mme esiin Isrel ke Silo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke inuausʌñ atayad mbono. Ntom ke ammọ ekebakka isọñ ema.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Abio Udịbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Yọsua ate: <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Dọkkọ nditọ Isrel bo yak esio mme abio ubọkkọ enịm, naña ami ñkeboiyo ke Moses idọkkọ ndufo, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />mbaak awo ndomokeed a-awotto awo ke ndudue me unana adidiọọñọ akeme adifeghe ñkedịbe do mbọkkọ asiousiene iyiib. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Ammọ emaefeghe eka keed ke atu mme abio ami, yak ammọ eda ke inuaatob abio ado enyʌñ etañ se ikido enọ mme ñkpisọñ abio ado. Ndin mme ñkpisọñ ado enie edidat utọ awo ado nsịn ke abio ammọ ñnyʌñ nnọọ anye itie nọ adʌñ ke atu ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Asiousiene iyiib akpebịne anye, inaaha mme ñkpisọñ eyaak awodawo ado esịn anye ke ubọk, sia awodawo ado ikifiọkkọfiọk iwot mbọhọidʌñ ammọ, ikinyʌññọ inie idiọọkesịd ibaña anye. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Yak ammọ edʌñ ke idʌñ ado tutu ammọ ekaa ikpe ke iso esob, ñko tutu ekamba aku a-akebaaha idaha ado akpa. Ndin ammọ ekeme editịmme ñnyọñ ufọk ammọ ke abio a-ammọ eketooho edi.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Ndin ammọ emaesio Kedes ke Kalili ke abod-abod abio Naftali, Sekem ke abod-abod abio Ifrem, ye Kiriad Aba (a-adooho, Hibrọn) ke abod-abod abio Yuda enịm. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan (ke edem Yeriko uko) ammọ emaesio Besa ke anaan ke unaisọñ ke esiin Rubịn, Ramọd ke Kilied ke esiin Kad, ye Kolan ke Basan ke esiin Manase enịm. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Awo Isrel ndomokeed, me asenawo ndomokeed a-adʌññọ ke atu ammọ a-akedueghe awot awo amaanie unen adifeghe ñkaa mme abio e-ekesioho enịm do mbaak asiousiene iyiib adiwot anye mbemiso anye akaa ikpe ke iso esob.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s1">Abio Mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Akema mme mbọọñ ufọk mme Lifai emaedibịne aku Eliasa, Yọsua ayịn Nọn, ye mbọọñ ufọk ubon Isrel mfen <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />ke Silo ke Kenan edibo ammọ ete, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ uyio ato Moses ate yak afo inọ ñnyịn mme abio idʌñ, ye isọñ awawa mbid se mme ufene ñnyịn edia ñkpọ.”<verse eid="JOS 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Ndin, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio, nditọ Isrel emaesio mme abio ami ye isọñ awawa mbid ke udeeme ammọ enọ mbon Lifai:<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Akpa afia akedʌk anọ mbon Kohad, ke ubon ke ubon. Mme Lifai, e-ekedooho mbon ubon aku Erọn emaebọ abio duob mme ita eto mme esiin Yuda, Simiọn ye Benyamin.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Emaedeeme abio duob eto mme ubon Ifrem enọ nditọ Kohad se ikisʌhọ, Daan ye ubaak esiin Manase.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Emaedeeme abio duob mme ita eto mme idʌñ ke ubon Isaka, Asaa, Naftali ye ubaak esiin Manase ke Basan enọ nditọ Kesọn.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Nditọ Merari, ke ubon ke ubon, emaebọ abio duob mme iba eto mme esiin Rubịn, Kad ye Sebulọn.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Ntom ke nditọ Isrel ekedeeme mme abio ami ye mme isọñ awawa mbid enọ mme Lifai, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeboiyo ke Moses atañ.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Ammọ emaedeeme mme abio ekesaiya anyịñ do eto esiin Yuda ye Simiọn. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Mme abio ami edo se ekenọọ nditọ Erọn e-eketooho ubon Kohad ke esiin Lifai, sia akpa afia akedʌk anọ ammọ:<verse eid="JOS 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Ekenọ ammọ Kiriad Aba (a-adooho, Hibrọn), ye mme isọñ awawa mbid a-akannake anye akʌk, ke abod-abod abio Yuda. (Aaba akedo eteete Anak.) <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Ado ammọ emaenọ Kaleb ayịn Yefune mme inwañ ye mme esịd idʌñ ammọ ebo edat nte inie amọ. <verse eid="JOS 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Ndin ammọ emaeben Hibrọn (abio e-ekenịmme nte itie ubọkkọ mme awodawo) enọ ubon aku Erọn, Libna, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Yattia, Estemoa, <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holon, Debi, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Ain, Yuta ye Bed Semes, ñkọrọ mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio usʌkkeed eto esiin iba ami, enọ nditọ aku Erọn.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Ke esiin Benyamin emaenọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:17">Kibiọn, Keba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anatod ye Almọn, ñkọrọ mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ.<verse eid="JOS 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Afịd abio mme aku, nditọ Erọn, ekedo duob mme ita, dian mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Emaedeeme abio ke ubon Ifrem enọ mbon Kohad ke esiin Lifai se ikisʌhọ:<verse eid="JOS 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Ke abod-abod abio Ifrem ekenọ ammọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:21">Sekem (abio e-ekenịmme nte itie ubọkkọ mme awodawo), ye Kesa, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Kibsaim ye Bed Họrọn, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ.<verse eid="JOS 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Ñko ke esiin Daan ammọ emaebọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:23">Elteke, Kibetọn, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />Aiyalọn ye Kad Rimọn, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ.<verse eid="JOS 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Ke ubaak esiin Manase ammọ emaebọ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:25">Taanak ye Kad Rimọn, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio iba.<verse eid="JOS 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Ekenọ mme ubon Kohad se ikisʌhọ afịd abio duob ami ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Ekenọ mme Kesọn, keed ke atu ubon mme Lifai:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:27">ke ubaak esiin Manase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:27">Kolan ke Basan (abio e-ekenịmme nte itie ubọkkọ mbon edotto uyio uwodawo) ye Be Estera, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio iba;<verse eid="JOS 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />ke esiin Isaka:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:28">Kisiọn, Daberad, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Yamuud ye En Kanịm, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ;<verse eid="JOS 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />ke esiin Asaa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:30">Misal, Abdọn, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helkad ye Rehob, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ;<verse eid="JOS 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />ke esiin Naftali:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:32">Kedes ke Kalili (abio e-ekenịmme nte itie ubọkkọ mme awodawo), Hamọd Dọọ ye Katan, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio ita.<verse eid="JOS 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Afịd abio mme ubon Kesọn ekedo duob mme ita, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Ekenọ mme ubon Merari (mbon Lifai se isʌhọ):</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JOS 21:34">Ke esiin Sebulọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:34">Yokneem, Kata, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimna ye Nahalal, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ;<verse eid="JOS 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />ke esiin Rubịn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:36">Besa, Yahas, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemọd ye Mefaad, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ufene ammọ, abio inaañ;<verse eid="JOS 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />ke esiin Kad:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JOS 21:38">Ramọd ke Kilied (abio e-ekenịmme nte itie ubọkkọ mme awodawo), Mahanaim, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Hesbọn ye Yasa, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ, abio inaañ ke afịd.<verse eid="JOS 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Afịd abio se ekedeeme enọ ubon Merari, e-ekedooho mbon esiin Lifai se ikisʌhọ, ekedo duob mme iba.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Afịd abio mme Lifai ke esịd udeeme nditọ Isrel ekedo aba mme itiaita, ye mme isọñ awawa mbid ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Awawa mbid amaakanna akʌk mme abio ami keedekeed; afịd mme abio ado ekeba ntoro.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ Isrel afịd isọñ se anye akenwọñọ adinọ mme eteete ammọ, ammọ emaenyʌñ edat isọñ ado enie enyʌñ edʌñ ke esịd. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ ammọ nduọkadudu akanna akʌk, kpa naña akenwọñọ anọ mme eteete ammọ. Asua ammọ ndomokeed ikikanna ida ammọ ke iso; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaak afịd mme asua ammọ asịn ammọ ke ubọk. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Ndomo eti enwọñọ Abọọñ keed a-anye akenwọñọke anọ Isrel ikikpuuho; afịd ammọ emaesu.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Esiin Edem Usakkautịn Enyọñọ Idʌñ Ammọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Ndin Yọsua amaakoot mbon Rubịn, mbon Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />anyʌñ abo ammọ ate, “Ndufo emenam afịd se Moses isʌñutom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo enam, ndin ndufo emenyʌñ ekop uyio mmi ke afịd se ami ñkebo enam. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Ke anyan ini ami, tutu awuọ mfịn, ndufo ifegheke ikpọñ emọ-emọ nditọ Isrel ndufo, ado emenam utom se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akinọọ abo enam. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Idaha ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaanọ ammọ nduọkadudu naña akenwọñọ, itiime inyọñọ ufọk idʌñ ndufo ke isọñ ake Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akinọọhọ ndufo ke ukañ Yọdan uko. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Ado itịm ikpeme adinịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed ake Moses awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akinọọhọ ndufo: ate ema <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, esaña ke ñkobitem amọ, enịm mme mbed amọ, emʌm anye ekama ubọk asọñ, enyʌñ enam ñkpọ inọ anye ke afịd esịd ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo.”<verse eid="JOS 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Ndin Yọsua amaadiọñ ammọ anyʌñ asio ammọ unyọñ, ammọ emaenyʌñ enyọñọ ufọk idʌñ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />(Moses amaanọ ubaak esiin Manase isọñ ke Basan, ndin ubaak anye ako Yọsua amaanọ isọñ ke ukañ usobutịn Yọdan ke atu nditọ Isrel ammọ.) Ke ini Yọsua akesioho ammọ unyọñ, anye amaadiọñ ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />ate, “Itiime inyọñọ ufọk idʌñ ndufo ye uwak inie ndufo ye uwak ufene, ye silfa, kold, brọns ye ukwak, ye ataa uwak afọñidem inyʌñ ideeme mbịme se ekebịme eto mme asua ndufo ye mme nditọ Isrel mfen.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Ndin mbon Rubịn, mbon Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase emaenyọñọ ekpọñ nditọ Isrel ke Silo ke Kenan ekaa Kilied, isọñ udeeme ammọ, a-ammọ ekedatta akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke ubọk Moses.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Ke ammọ emaekekewuọ Kelilọd a-akpereke Yọdan ke Kenan, mbon Rubịn, mbon Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase emaebọp ekamba uyaiya akpokoro uwa ke mben Yọdan. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Ndin ke ini nditọ Isrel ekekoppo ke mbon Rubịn, mbon Kad, ye ubaak mbon Manase emaebọp akpokoro uwa ke adaña Kenan ke Kelilọd a-akpereke Yọdan ukañ nditọ Isrel, <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />afịd esob nditọ Isrel emaekesoobo ke Silo adika ekọñ ye ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Ndin nditọ Isrel emaedọñ Finehas ayịn aku Eliasa, utom ke abio Kilied, enọ Rubịn, Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Ammọ emaenọ mbọọñ duob esaña ye anye, awo keedekeed ke mme esiin Isrel, ndin afịd ammọ ekedo mbọọñ ufọk mme ete ammọ ke atu mme ekpək ke Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Ke ammọ emaekekewuọ Kilied, esoobo ye Rubịn, Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase, ammọ emaebo ammọ ete: <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Afịd esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ebo ete: ‘Ekpenam die enana mbuọdidem ke idem Abasi Isrel ntom? Nsoo inam ndufo ekpa edem ewọt <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ebọp akpokoro uwa enọ idem ndufo ke nsọñiwuod ye anye idahami? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Nte idiọọkñkpọ Pio ikikemme ye ñnyịn? Tutu mfịn ami ñnyịn inamma idem ñnyịn asana ke idiọọkñkpọ ado, akpesʌkado idiọọk udọñọ amaadidʌk ke atu ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>! <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Ndin idahami ndufo eyem ediwọññọ iso ñkpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 22:18">“ ‘Ndufo ekpesọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mfịn ami, ñkpọñ anye ayaayat esịd ye afịd esob Isrel. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Akpedo udeeme isọñ ndufo ado ndedeghe, idi isọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, itie se tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ada, inyʌñ idiwana isọñ ado ye ñnyịn. Ado ikiisọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> me ye ñnyịn ke adibọp akpokoro uwa nnọọ idem ndufo, ibọhọke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Ke ini Ekan ayịn Seera akenamma idiọọk ido ke abaña mme asaña-asaña ñkpọ nsobo, nte iyadesịd ikisịmeke afịd esob Isrel? Idooho anye ikpọọñ akekpa ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ amọ.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ndin Rubịn, Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase emaebọọrọ mme mbọọñ ekpək Isrel ete: <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Akpọsọñ Abasi, Abasi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>! Akpọsọñ Abasi, Abasi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>! Anye adiọọñọ! Ndin yak Isrel ñko ediọọñọ! Akpedo nsọñiwuod me ntịdutọñ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ñnyịn inam ami, ikiinyaaña ñnyịn mfịn ami. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Akpedo ñnyịn ibọp akpokoro uwa inọ idem ñnyịn nọ ato do ñnyịn itịmme ikpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌñ iwa ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ñkpasi, me adiwa uwa ewuana ke esịd, yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem amọ akpe ikpe ñnyịn.<verse eid="JOS 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />“Iyoo! Ndịk akinam ñnyịn inam ami, sia ñnyịn imaikere ke usen keed nditọ ndufo ekeme edidibo nditọ ñnyịn, ‘Ndufo esaña nsoo ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Isrel? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm Yọdan nte adaña ke ufọọd ñnyịn ye ndufo, ndufo mme Rubịn ye mbon Kad! Ndufo inieghe udeeme ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ Ndin nditọ ndufo ekeme edinam nditọ ñnyịn etre edibaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JOS 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />“Ado akenam ñnyịn ibo, ‘Yak ibeeñe idem ibọp akpokoro uwa, ado idooho ake ufọfọb uwa me utọ uwa mfen.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />Utu ke ado, adinam ado ntiense ke ufọọd ñnyịn ye ndufo ye mme emana se idiikeene ñnyịn, ite ke ñnyịn iyaikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adisana itie amọ ye ufọfọb uwa ñnyịn, mme uwa mfen ye uwa ewuana. Ndin ke ini iso nditọ ndufo idiikanna ibo nditọ ñnyịn, ‘Ndufo inieghe udeeme ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’<verse eid="JOS 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />“Ndin ñnyịn imaibo ite, ‘Ammọ ekpetañ utọ ikọ ami ye ñnyịn, me ye nditọ ñnyịn, ñnyịn iyaibọọrọ ibo: Kap se mbid akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-mme eteete ñnyịn ekebọppọ, idooho ake ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa mfen, ado anye ado ntiense ke ufọọd ñnyịn ye ndufo.’<verse eid="JOS 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />“Nsaa ñnyịn-o, ñnyịn idikpisọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ ntịmme edem ñkpọñ anye mfịn ami ke adibọp akpokoro uwa nnọọ ufọfọb uwa, uwa ñkpasi ye mme uwa mfen, ke amaaboiyo akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn a-adaaha ke atayad amọ.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Ke ini aku Finehas ye mme adadusʌñ ke idʌñ, mme mbọọñ ekpək mme nditọ Isrel, ekekoppo se Rubịn, Kad ye Manase ekenie editañ, ammọ emaenem esịd. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Ndin Finehas ayịn aku Eliasa, amaabo Rubịn, Kad ye Manase ate, “Mfịn ñnyịn imidiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ye ñnyịn, sia ndufo imiinamma idiọọk ido ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ñkpọ ami. Idaha ado ndufo emebọ nditọ Isrel esuuk ke ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Ndin Finehas ayịn aku Eliasa, ye mme adadusʌñ ado emaetịmme enyọñọ Kenan ke ammọ emaekesoobo ye mbon Rubịn ye mbon Kad ke Kilied enyʌñ ekedọkkọ nditọ Isrel naña akedo. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Nditọ Isrel emaenem esịd edikop naña akedo enyʌñ etooro Abasi. Ndin ammọ ikitañña aba edika ekọñ ñkesobo itie nte mbon Rubịn ye mbon Kad ekedʌñọ.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Ndin mbon Rubịn ye mbon Kad emaesio akpokoro uwa ado anyịñ ami: Ntiense Ke Ufọọd Ñnyịn nte ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi.<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yọsua Akọọm Mme Adadusʌñ Unyọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Ke anyan ini amaakeboiyo ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Isrel nduọkadudu, asio ke ubọk afịd mme asua ammọ e-ekekannake ammọ ekʌk. Ke Yọsua amaakekappa ataa akaanadeen, <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />anye Yọsua amaakoot afịd Isrel, mme ñkpisọñ ammọ, mme adadusʌñ, mme akpeikpe ye mme adaaha anyʌñ abo ammọ ate: “Ami mmesọñ eti-eti. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Ndufo ke idem ndufo emekịt afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anam ye afịd idịd ami ke ntak ndufo; ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenwana ekọñ inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Itoiyo naña ami ñke abakka afịd isọñ mme idịd se isʌhọ nnọ mme esiin ndufo ke udeeme mme idịd a-ami ñkekanna ke ekọñ, atọọñọ ke Yọdan tutu awuọ Akpa Mediterenia ke ukañ usobutịn. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke idem amọ ayaanək ammọ asio ke ntak ndufo. Anye ayaabịn ammọ asio ke iso ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedat isọñ ammọ enie, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenwọñọ inọọ.<verse eid="JOS 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />“Inekke isọñ ubọk; itịm inịm afịd se ewet ke Ñwed Mbed Moses, ikiiwakka ikaa nnasia me ufiin. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Ikiinie ewuana ye mme idịd esʌhọke ke atu ndufo mi; ikiikoot anyịñ mme abasi ammọ, ikiinyʌñ inwọñọ ñkpọ ke anyịñ ammọ. Inaaha enam ñkpọ enọ ammọ me enʌhọ enọ ammọ. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Ado ana esọñ ubọk eyịre <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, kpa naña enam tutu awuọ idahami.<verse eid="JOS 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-abịne mme ñkpọsọñ ye mme anie adudu idịd asio ke iso ndufo; awo ndomokeed ikemeke adida ndufo ke iso tutu awuọ usen mfịn ami. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Awo ndufo keed abịne tọsịn keed, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anwana ekọñ inọọ ndufo, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Anam ndufo inekke ikpeme edima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="JOS 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />“Ado ndufo ekpewọññọ edem enyʌñ ekediana ye mbon idịd ami se isʌhọ ke atu ndufo enyʌñ edọ ndọ ke atu ammọ enyʌñ enie ewuana ye ammọ, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />inekke idiọọñọ ibo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiibịneke mme idịd ami aba isio ke iso ndufo. Utu ke ado, ammọ eyaekappa edo mfịna ye mme afia inọ ndufo, ye ikpa ke edem ndufo ye ñkukịm ke anyen ndufo, tutu ndufo etak ke eti isọñ ami, ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Ndin idahami ami ñyaaka usʌñ afịd ederimbod. Ndufo emediọọñọ ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo ebo ke eti enwọñọ ndomokeed ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akinọọhọ ndufo nọ akpu ibaaha. Afịd enwọñọ asu; ndomokeed ikpuuho. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Ado kpa naña afịd nti ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenwọñọ asuuhọ inọọ ndufo, kpa ntoro ke anye adiinam afịd ndiọi ñkpọ se anye aduak inọọ ndufo asu, tutu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo isobo ndufo asio ke eti isọñ ami a-anye inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Ndufo ekpebiat edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-anye akiwuuho ndufo ate enam, enyʌñ ekaa ekenam ñkpọ enọ mme abasi mfen enyʌñ etuak iwuod enọ ammọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayat esịd ye ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaesọsọp esobo ewuọ ke eti isọñ a-anye inọọhọ ndufo.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s1">Edemme Edioomo ke Sekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Akema Yọsua amaakoot afịd esiin Isrel abok ke Sekem. Anye amaakoot mme ñkpisọñ, mme adadusʌñ, mme abiideikpe ye mme adaaha Isrel, ndin ammọ emaedi ke iso Abasi.<verse eid="JOS 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yọsua amaabo afịd awo ate, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel abo ado ami: ‘Ke ataa anyan ini ko mme eteete ndufo, ye Tera ete Ebraham ye Nahọ, ekedʌñ ke edem Inyañ Yufretis enyʌñ ekpono mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Ado ami mmaaben ete ndufo Ebraham nsio ke ukañ Yufretis uko ñnyʌñ mben anye nsaña ke afịd isọñ Kenan ñnyʌñ nnọ anye uwak nditọ. Ami mmaanọ anye Aisik, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />ndin mmaanọ Aisik Yekọb ye Isọ. Ami mmaadeeme abod-abod abio Sei nnọ Isọ, ado Yekọb ye ubon amọ emaesọiyọ ekaa Iyib.<verse eid="JOS 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />“ ‘Akekem ami mmaadọñ Moses ye Erọn utom, ñnyʌñ ntʌkkọ mbon Iyib ato ke se ami ñkenam do, ndin isịññe ndufo ke udo. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Ke ini ami mmaakesịññe mbon ndufo ke Iyib, ndufo emaediwuọ akpainyañ, ndin mbon Iyib emaeben mme sariọd ye mme awad enañmbakara ibịne ndufo tutu ekewuọ Ndad-ndad Inyañ. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Ado ammọ emaeseeme enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> eyem unwam, ndin anye amaasịn ekịm ke ufọọd ndufo ye mbon Iyib; anye amaanam akpainyañ atọ adọọk afʌk ammọ. Ndufo emaedat anyen ndufo ekịt se ami ñkenam mbon Iyib. Ndin ndufo emaedʌñ ke anaan ekpeene.<verse eid="JOS 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />“ ‘Ami mmaiben ndufo ndʌk ke isọñ a-mbon Amọọ ekedʌññọ ke ukañ usakkautịn Yọdan. Ammọ emaenwana ekọñ ye ndufo, ado ami mmaayaak ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk. Ami mmaasobo ammọ ke iso ndufo nsio, ndin ndufo emaedat isọñ ammọ enie. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Ke ini Balak ayịn Sipọọ, adidem Mọb, akenamma mbeeñeidem adinwana ekọñ ye Isrel, anye amaadọñ ekoot Balaam ayịn Beo nọ adisuuñọ ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Ado ami ñkekpañña utọñ nnọ Balaam, anam anye amaakappa idiọñ ndufo amaana idiọñ, ndin ami isio ndufo ke ubọk amọ.<verse eid="JOS 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />“ ‘Akema ndufo emaeboiyo Yọdan ediwuọ Yeriko. Mme unie Yeriko emaenwana ekọñ ye ndufo, naña mbon Amọọ, mbon Peris, mbon Kenan, mbon Hed, mbon Keekasi, ye mbon Hif ye mbon Yebus ekenam, ado ami mmaayaak ammọ nsịn ke ubọk ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Ami mmaadọñ ataad nte ibem ndufo iso, ndin anye amaabịn ammọ asio ke iso ndufo, ye mme ndidem Amọọ iba ado ñko. Ndufo ikinamma ami ye akañkañ ye utịgha ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Ke ntoro ami mmainọ ndufo isọñ a-ndufo imiikinamma utom ke esịd ye mme abio a-ndufo imiikibọppọ; ndin ndufo emaedʌk edʌñ enyʌñ edia eto inwañ fain ye ọlif a-ndufo imiikitọọhọ.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />“Ndin idahami ndufo ibaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ anye ke ayọhọ akpanikọ. Iduọọñọ mme abasi a-mme eteete ndufo ekekponoke ke edem Inyañ Yufretis uko ye ke Iyib, inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ado akpedo adinam ñkpọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ifọnnọ ndufo ke idem, mfịn ami imek inọ idem ndufo anye a-ndufo ediinam ñkpọ inọ, me mme abasi a-mme eteete ndufo ekenamma ñkpọ enọ ke edem Yufretis uko, me mme abasi mbon Amọọ a-ndufo edʌññọ ke isọñ ammọ. Ado amaado ami ye ufọk mmi, ñnyịn idiinam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Ndin atu awo emaebọọrọ ete, “Nsaa ñnyịn-o! Abasi akan ñnyịn edikpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñkenam ñkpọ nnọọ mme abasi mfen! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ke idem amọ akisio ñnyịn ye mme ete ñnyịn ke Iyib, ke isọñ ufʌn ado, anyʌñ anam mme ikpọ idiọọñọ ke iso ñnyịn. Anye amaikpeme ñnyịn ke afịd usʌñ isañ ñnyịn, ye ke atu afịd mme idịd a-ñnyịn ikisañake ke ufọọd ammọ iboiyo. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyʌñ abịne afịd idịd ado asio ke iso ñnyịn, ñkọrọ mbon Amọọ, e-ekedʌññọ ke isọñ ado. Ñnyịn ñko iyainam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye ado Abasi ñnyịn.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Yọsua amaabo atu awo ate, “Ndufo ikanna inam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Anye ado adisana Abasi; anye ado Abasi ufịb. Anye idiifeene inọ ke nsọñiwuod ye idiọọkñkpọ ndufo. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Ndufo ekpekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ekenam ñkpọ enọ mme asen abasi, anye ndin ayaakappa inam ndufo idiọọk anyʌñ isobo ndufo, ke anye amaakefọn ye ndufo ima.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Ado atu awo emaebo Yọsua ete, “Iyoo! Ñnyịn iyainam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo ate, “Ndufo edo mme ntiense ebaña idem ndufo nte ke ndufo ememek edinam ñkpọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Ii, ñnyịn ido mme ntiense.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Yọsua amaabo, “A-afọn, idahami, iduọọñọ mme asen abasi e-ebaaha ke atu ndufo inyʌñ iyaak esịd ndufo inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ndin atu awo emaebo Yọsua ete, “Ñnyịn iyainam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inyʌñ ikop item inọ anye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Usen ado Yọsua amaanam edioomo anọ atu awo, ndin ke ndo ke Sekem anye amaamaana adọkkọ ammọ mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Ndin Yọsua amaawet mme ñkpọ ami asịn ke Ñwed Mbed Abasi. Akema anye amaaben ekamba itiad keed awuuk do ke idak afriyo a-akedaaha adiana adisana itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="JOS 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Ndin Yọsua amaabo atu awo ate, “Sese! Itiad ami ayaado ntiense ibaña ñnyịn. Anye a-akop afịd ikọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idọkkọ ñnyịn. Anye ayaado ntiense ibaña ndufo adieke ndufo ekañña Abasi ndufo.”<verse eid="JOS 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Akema Yọsua amaanam atu awo enyọñ eka itie udeeme ammọ.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebuuk Yọsua ke Isọñ Enwọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Ke mme ñkpọ ami emaekeboiyo, Yọsua ayịn awodeen Nọn, awo utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, amaakpa ke amaakeyọhọ isua ikie mme duob (110). <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Ndin ammọ emaebuuk anye ke udeeme isọñ amọ, ke Timnad Sera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enyʌñ ediọọñọ nte Timnad Heres (se ke Ñwed Mme Abiideikpe 2:9)</char></note> ke abod-abod abio Ifrem, ke edem adoro Abod Kaas.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Isrel emaenam ñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd ayio uwem Yọsua ye ke afịd ayio uwem mme ñkpisọñ e-ekeduuho uwem ekpeene ekan Yọsua, e-ekenyʌññọ ekịt afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam anọ Isrel.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Ndin emaebuuk mme akpọ Yosef, a-nditọ Isrel ekekoonoke eto Iyib edi, ke Sekem ke inwañ a-Yekọb akedeppe ke mbaak silfa ikie ato nditọ Hamọọ, ete Sekem. Isọñ ami amaakappa adʌk ke udeeme nditọ Yosef.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Akekem Eliasa ayịn Erọn amaakpa ndin emaebuuk anye ke Kibie, e-ekenọọhọ ayịn awodeen amọ Finehas ke abod-abod abio Ifrem.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>